ced-eac","content":"EAC（界面中显示为 **EAC (co-paid)**）是一条通过中继访问的共付渠道：中继说 OpenAI Chat Completions 协议，只为完成了授权的安装提供服务。它没有匿名模式，配置了账号才会运行；在账号出现之前，`GET /api/v1/providers` 也会列出它并标注 `requires_authorization: true`，网页上据此提示它需要授权。","locale":"zh-CN"},"13":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#用内置中继开通","content":"Hoshimi 内置了一个中继的地址和签名凭据，全新安装只需要完成 GitHub 授权：","locale":"zh-CN"},"14":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#发起登录","content":"在 **渠道** 页打开 EAC，点 **登录**；或在命令行运行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"15":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#发起登录","content":"命令会打印并在浏览器中打开中继的 GitHub 授权链接（`--no-open` 只打印不打开）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"16":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#在-github-上授权","content":"在打开的页面中用 GitHub 账号授权。中继要求这个 GitHub 账号已经为上游仓库点过 Star，否则登录失败并提示 `the GitHub account has not starred the upstream repository`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"17":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#完成","content":"授权成功后，Hoshimi 在 `config.json` 中创建账号 `eac-default`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"18":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#完成","content":"同时把授权令牌保存到数据目录的 `eac-user.json`（仅所有者可读写）。内置中继的签名凭据不会写进配置文件，每次请求时临时解出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"19":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#完成","content":"EAC 的模型在列表中以 `EAC` 开头显示，如 **EAC Kimi K3**。它们的 id 带有上游的组织前缀，例如 `moonshotai/kimi-k3`、`z-ai/glm-5.3`、`opencode/glm-5.3-flash-free`。中继的模型列表拿不到时，使用内置的后备列表。大部分模型有自己的推理档位，见模型与账号行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"20":{"id":"/docs/advanced-eac-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-eac","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-eac#两种中继模式","content":"账号的凭据决定模式：","l