ags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型目录","content":"**防止异常缩水**：新拉到的列表不到上一次的一半时，先保留旧列表一个周期，并在日志里警告 `the catalogue came back at N of M models (likely a partial answer)`；再过一个周期仍然如此，才接受新列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"160":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型目录","content":"**失败时保留旧的**：拉取失败时保留上一次成功的目录，30 秒后再试。从未成功过的渠道使用它内置的后备列表；后备列表只是历史数据，不代表这些模型现在可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"161":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型目录","content":"**跨重启保留**：每次成功的目录保存在数据目录的 `catalog-cache/` 中，启动时先恢复（只恢复 7 天以内、账号和选项完全相同的快照），然后立即在后台刷新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"162":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#模型目录","content":"网页界面的 **模型** 页和 Playground 通过 `GET /api/v1/catalog/stream`（SSE）加载目录：先发出已缓存的结果，再按渠道逐个发出新结果。拉取最多同时进行 8 个；一轮最多等 20 秒，没完成的渠道标记为超时，已经收到的模型保留。标准的 `/v1/models` 仍然是普通 JSON。","locale":"zh-CN"},"163":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#能力信息","content":"管理接口 `GET /api/v1/models` 给出每个模型的能力：","locale":"zh-CN"},"164":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#能力信息","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"165":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#能力信息","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"166":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#能力信息","content":"`vision`","locale":"zh-CN"},"167":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-models#能力信息","content":"能否读图","locale":"zh-CN"},"168":{"id":"/docs/advanced-models-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-models","tags":[],"type":"text