zh-CN"},"729":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-45","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发","content":"流式响应逐帧保留上游的 SSE，包括未知事件、用量、签名和 ping；Hoshimi 只在完整的帧之间插入自己的 `ping`，不会插进半截 JSON。非流式的 JSON 也原样返回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"730":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-46","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发","content":"上游的流没有以 `message_stop` 或 `error` 结束，或在一帧中途断开时，Hoshimi 报告错误，而不是当作正常结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"731":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-47","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发","content":"客户端断开时，Hoshimi 关闭上游连接；已经开始的流不会换账号重放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"732":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-48","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发","content":"上游错误保留状态码、响应体、请求 ID 和协议头（包括 `x-should-retry`、`retry-after`、`anthropic-ratelimit-*`）。上游明确返回 `x-should-retry: false` 时，Hoshimi 不再换账号重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"733":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-49","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#原生转发","content":"能原样转发不等于上游都支持：Anthropic 形式的端点仍可能拒绝它没有实现的功能，原始错误会返回给客户端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"734":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-50","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#协议转换","content":"转换路径把 Messages 请求变成内部的 Chat 请求，交给渠道的适配器，再把结果变回 Messages。","locale":"zh-CN"},"735":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-51","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#请求字段","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"736":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-52","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#请求字段","content":"处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"737":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-53","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#请求字段","content":"`system`","locale":"zh-CN"},"738":{"id":"/docs/api-anthropic-54","page_id":"/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-anthropic#请求字段",