-CN"},"953":{"id":"/docs/api-management-99","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"`local`","locale":"zh-CN"},"954":{"id":"/docs/api-management-100","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"这个请求是否来自服务器本机","locale":"zh-CN"},"955":{"id":"/docs/api-management-101","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"`api_prefix`","locale":"zh-CN"},"956":{"id":"/docs/api-management-102","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"嵌入到其他应用时的路径前缀，独立运行时为空","locale":"zh-CN"},"957":{"id":"/docs/api-management-103","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"`data_dir` / `config_path`","locale":"zh-CN"},"958":{"id":"/docs/api-management-104","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"数据目录和配置文件路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"959":{"id":"/docs/api-management-105","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"`default_model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"960":{"id":"/docs/api-management-106","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"默认模型，没有时为 `null`","locale":"zh-CN"},"961":{"id":"/docs/api-management-107","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"`providers` / `accounts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"962":{"id":"/docs/api-management-108","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"已启用的渠道数和账号数（不含匿名账号）","locale":"zh-CN"},"963":{"id":"/docs/api-management-109","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#应用","content":"`GET /app/update` 返回 `status`、`current`、`latest`（PyPI 上最新的正式版本，知道后才有）和 `checked_at`（最近一次成功检查的 Unix 秒）。`status` 为 `checking`（首次检查尚未完成）、`available`、`current`、`failed`（还没有成功过；之后的失败保留上次的结果）或 `disabled`（`server.check_updates` 关闭）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"964":{"id":"/docs/api-management-110","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"`GET /settings` 返回当前设置：`data_dir`、`config_path`、`server`（地址、端口、`strict_port`、`access_token_configured`、`model_api_key_configured`、允许的 CIDR/主机/来源、`max_body_bytes`、`max_account_retries`、`default_model`、`auto_refresh`、`auto_checkin`、`check_updates`、`stats_keep_days`）、`providers`（每个渠道的 `id`、`enabled`、账号数、已设置的选项名、网络设置）、`network`、`playground`，以及：","locale":"zh-CN"},"965":{"id":"/docs/api-management-111","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"`restart_required`：保存的 `server.host` / `server.port` 与本次启动时不同，需要重启才生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"966":{"id":"/docs/api-management-112","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"`playground.workspace_path`、`playground.shell_in_effect` 和 `playground.shells`（只读）：工具实际的工作目录、调用未指定 shell 时命令运行所用的 shell（`auto` 已解析），以及本机已安装的 shell。","locale":"zh-CN"},"967":{"id":"/docs/api-management-113","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"`listening`：实际监听的套接字，`port` 为绑定的端口，`requested_port` 为开始尝试的端口，`fallback` 表示请求的端口被占用而改用了其他端口（这不是需要重启的原因）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"968":{"id":"/docs/api-management-114","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"密钥本身永远不会返回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"969":{"id":"/docs/api-management-115","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"`PATCH /settings` 的请求体是部分配置，按 `config.json` 的结构深度合并，校验通过后写入配置文件并应用到运行中的网关，返回新的设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"970":{"id":"/docs/api-management-116","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"`server.access_token` 或 `server.model_api_key` 设为 `null`（或空字符串）表示清除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"971":{"id":"/docs/api-management-117","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"无效的值返回 `400` 并说明原因，例如绑定非回环地址却没有同时设置 `security.allow_cidrs` 和 `server.access_token`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"972":{"id":"/docs/api-management-118","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"改了监听地址或端口时，`restart_required` 变为 `true`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"973":{"id":"/docs/api-management-119","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"`{\"playground\": {\"approval\": \"auto\"}}` 会保存为 `workspace`，即该模式的新名称。","locale":"zh-CN"},"974":{"id":"/docs/api-management-120","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#设置","content":"配置项的含义见配置文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"975":{"id":"/docs/api-management-121","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`GET /providers` 的每一项：`id`、`display_name`、`accounts`（不含匿名账号）、`account_ids`、`models`（已缓存的模型数，从不为此请求上游）、`enabled`、`keyless`（无需账号即可使用）、`requires_authorization`（需要登录或 Key 才能使用）。已配置但关闭的渠道、可以登录或填 Key 但尚未配置的渠道也会列出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"976":{"id":"/docs/api-management-122","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`GET /provider-forms` 列出每个渠道添加账号时可用的方式（`method`）及字段（`key`、`kind`、`required`、`choices`）和默认值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"977":{"id":"/docs/api-management-123","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`POST /providers/{provider_id}/accounts` 追加一个账号，请求体中的 `account` 与写在 `config.json` 里的形式完全相同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"978":{"id":"/docs/api-management-124","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"只追加，不替换已有账号；渠道先检查账号是否可用，不可用时返回 `400`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"979":{"id":"/docs/api-management-125","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"没有写 `id` 时自动生成 `<渠道>-<序号>` 形式的 id；`id` 已存在时返回 `409`；渠道不存在时返回 `404`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"980":{"id":"/docs/api-management-126","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"渠道处于关闭状态时会被重新启用。账号同时写入配置文件和运行中的账号池。","locale":"zh-CN"},"981":{"id":"/docs/api-management-127","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`DELETE /providers/{provider_id}/accounts/{account_id}` 从配置文件和运行中的账号池删除账号，返回 `{\"provider\", \"account\", \"removed_from_config\"}`；从旧版数据目录导入、不在 `config.json` 中的账号只从账号池删除，此时 `removed_from_config` 为 `false`。两处都找不到时返回 `404`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"982":{"id":"/docs/api-management-128","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`GET /stations` 列出 `agg` 账号可以用 `preset` 指定的站点：`id`、`display_name`、`base_url`、`key_env`（只是告诉你该准备哪个 Key，Hoshimi 不读取这个环境变量）、`catalog_keyless`。见 聚合入口 agg。","locale":"zh-CN"},"983":{"id":"/docs/api-management-129","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`GET /channels` 一次返回渠道页需要的全部本地状态，不向上游发请求（余额需要请求上游，所以不在其中，见 `/credits`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"984":{"id":"/docs/api-management-130","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"每个渠道：`id`、`display_name`、`enabled`、`keyless`、`configured`、`loginable`、`addable`、`forms`、`models`、`options`、`network`、`diagnostics`、`quota`（被动额度）、`accounts`、`usage_today`、`recent_checkins`（最近 5 次签到结果）和 `status`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"985":{"id":"/docs/api-management-131","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#渠道与账号","content":"`status`：`ok`；`attention`（仍可使用但有需要处理的问题：需要登录、令牌过期、账号被冷却、被限流或额度低于 10%）；`disabled`（被关闭）；`empty`（没有可用的账号）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"986":{"id":"/