age_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`efforts`、`effort_default`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/api-management-153","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"推理选项（`id`、`name`、`description`、`is_default`、`tokens`）和默认档位","locale":"zh-CN"},"1008":{"id":"/docs/api-management-154","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`probe`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/api-management-155","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"最近一次可用性探测的结果，没有探测过时为 `null`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/api-management-156","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`unavailable`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/api-management-157","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"是否被暂时停用（站点对所有账号回答了 404/410）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/api-management-158","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`GET /catalog/stream` 是 SSE：先发一个 `snapshot` 事件，列出每个渠道的缓存模型（状态 `loading`）；然后每个渠道刷新完成时发一个 `provider` 事件（状态 `ready`、`failed` 或 20 秒后的 `timeout`，附带 `error`、`last_success`、`retry_at`、`source`）；最后发 `done`。等待期间发送 `: keep-alive` 注释。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/api-management-159","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`POST /models/unavailable/reset` 解除所有被暂时停用的模型，返回 `{\"cleared\": <数量>}`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/api-management-160","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#可用性探测","content":"`GET /probe` 返回 `running`、`at`（上一轮结束时间）、`results`（模型 → `state`、`detail`、`latency_ms`、`ttft_ms`、`at`）。`state` 为 `available`、`region-blocked`、`unavailable`、`throttled` 或 `unknown`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/api-management-161","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#可用性探测","content":"`POST /probe` 在后台开始一轮探测，请求体可选：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1016":{"id":"/docs/api-management-162","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#可用性探测","content":"不写 `models` 或为空数组时，探测所有需要探测的渠道的全部模型。返回同样的快照，另有 `started`（是否真的开始了新一轮；已有一轮在运行时为 `false`，轮次不会叠加）和 `unresolved`（无法解析的模型名）。探测的含义见模型与账号行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1017":{"id":"/docs/api-management-163","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#凭据续期","content":"`GET /refresh` 返回 `auto_refresh` 和每个账号的 `provider`、`account`、`refreshable`、`needs_login`、`expires_at`、`failures`、`last_error`、`last_ok`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1018":{"id":"/docs/api-management-164","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#凭据续期","content":"`POST /refresh` 立即续期即将到期的凭据，请求体可选：`{\"provider\": \"<渠道>\", \"force\": true}`（`force` 表示不管是否到期，续期所有可续期的账号）。返回每个账号的结果：`ok`、`persisted`（新凭据已写入配置）、`terminal`（站点拒绝了刷新令牌，需要重新登录）、`error`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/api-management-165","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"接口","locale":"zh-CN"},"1020":{"id":"/docs/api-management-166","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1021":{"id":"/docs/api-management-167","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"1022":{"id":"/docs/api-management-168","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`GET /credits`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1023":{"id":"/docs/api-management-169","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`provider`（可选）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/api-management-170","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`rows`（每个账号的 `available`、`unit`、`message`，会请求上游）、`passive`（从正常响应头读到的剩余额度，超过 5 分钟标为 `stale`）、`cooled`（被移出轮换的账号、原因 `rate_limited` 或 `policy_blocked`、剩余秒数）、`checkin`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/api-management-171","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`GET /credits/checkins`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1026":{"id":"/docs/api-management-172","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`provider`（可选）、`limit`（1–500，默认 50）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1027":{"id":"/docs/api-management-173","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"签到历史，新的在前，包括每日自动签到和手动领取；保留 365 天","locale":"zh-CN"},"1028":{"id":"/docs/api-management-174","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`POST /credits/claim`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1029":{"id":"/docs/api-management-175","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"请求体 `{\"provider\": \"<渠道>\"}`，省略表示所有渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/api-management-176","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"每个账号的 `status`、`credits`、`covers_today`、`message`；当天已签过的站点回答 `already`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1031":{"id":"/docs/api-management-177","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#登录","content":"浏览器授权和设备码登录分几步完成：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1032":{"id":"/docs/api-management-178","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#开始","content":"返回一个会话：`id`、`provider`、`status`、`login_url`（站点给出后出现）、`user_code` 和 `instructions`（设备码登录时）、`expires_at`、`waiting_for`、`message`。`GET /login/providers` 列出可以登录的渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1033":{"id":"/docs/api-management-179","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#轮询","content":"在浏览器中打开 `login_url` 完成授权，然后轮询直到 `status` 从 `pending` 变为 `succeeded`（`account_id` 为新账号）或 `failed`（`message` 说明原因）。会话不存在时返回 `404`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1034":{"id":"/docs/api-management-180","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#提交输入或取消","content":"站点需要额外输入时（`waiting_for` 不为空），用 `POST /login/input` 提交 `{\"session_id\": \"…\", \"value\": \"…\"}`。`POST /login/cancel?session_id=<会话 id>` 取消一个进行中的登录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1035":{"id":"/docs/api-management-181","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#提交输入或取消","content":"各站点的登录方式见渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1036":{"id":"/docs/api-management-182","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`GET /stats` 的参数：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1037":{"id":"/docs/api-management-183","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/api-management-184","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1039":{"id":"/docs/api-management-185","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`range`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1040":{"id":"/docs/api-management-186","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`24h`、`day`、`7d`（默认）、`30d`、`90d`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1041":{"id":"/docs/api-management-187","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`date`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1042":{"id":"/docs/api-management-188","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`range=day` 时的日期 `YYYY-MM-DD`（服务器本地时间，默认今天）；未来或格式错误的日期返回 `400`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1043":{"id":"/docs/api-management-189","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"返回 `totals`、`previous`（紧挨着的前一个同长时段；`day` 为前一天，今天则只比到同一时刻）、`latency`（首 Token 时间和生成速度的平均值、中位数、P95）、补零的 `series`、按模型/渠道/账号/来源的明细、`lifetime`，以及 `since`、`until`（不含）、`date`、`granularity`、`hourly`、`server_time`。`24h` 和 `day` 按小时（夏令时切换的一天为 23 或 25 小时），其余按天；小时数据保留 120 天，按天数据永久保留，没有小时数据的日子 `hourly` 为 `false`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1044":{"id":"/docs/api-management-190","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`GET /stats/days` 返回每个有用量的本地日期（`date`、`calls`、`tokens`、`failed`），从旧到新，以及 `first` 和 `today`，供日历使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1045":{"id":"/docs/api-management-191","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`GET /stats/calls` 返回逐次调用，新的在前，覆盖整个保留期（`server.stats_keep_days`，默认 90 天）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/api-management-192","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1047":{"id":"/docs/api-management-193","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1048":{"id":"/docs/api-management-194","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`limit`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1049":{"id":"/docs/api-management-195","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"1–200，默认 50","locale":"zh-CN"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/api-management-196","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`before`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1051":{"id":"/docs/api-management-197","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-man