pe":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`DELETE /stats` 清空所有计数和调用记录，返回 `{\"cleared_at\": …}`；正在进行的调用结束时仍会被记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/api-management-208","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#用量统计","content":"`GET /stats/live` 是 SSE，每帧 `data: <json>`：先发一个 `snapshot`（进行中的调用、今日合计、最近的调用），之后是 `started`、`progress`、`finished` 事件；每 15 秒发一次 `ping`。读取太慢跟不上时流会结束，重新连接会得到新的快照。进行中调用的 Token 数是按字符数估算的。用量的记录方式见用量统计。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1063":{"id":"/docs/api-openai","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","type":"page","content":"OpenAI 兼容接口","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","API 参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-openai","locale":"zh-CN"},"1064":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-0","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-openai","content":"/v1 下 OpenAI 兼容接口的参考：Chat Completions 与 Responses 的请求字段、响应和流式事件，模型列表，模型路由规则，推理强度的换算，以及分类接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1065":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-1","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-openai#chat-completions","content":"Chat Completions","locale":"zh-CN"},"1066":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-2","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-openai#请求","content":"请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"1067":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-3","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-openai#非流式响应","content":"非流式响应","locale":"zh-CN"},"1068":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-4","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-openai#流式响应","content":"流式响应","locale":"zh-CN"},"1069":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-5","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-openai#responses","content":"Responses","locale":"zh-CN"},"1070":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-6","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-openai#请求字段","content":"请求字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"1071":{"id":"/docs/api-openai-7","page_id":"/docs/api-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-openai