json`，在标准输出打印一行 `SERVER_READY url=<地址>`，并记录 `Hoshimi running on <地址>`。监听 `0.0.0.0` 或 `::` 时，打印的地址用 `127.0.0.1`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1905":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-67","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#serve","content":"启用了 `--open` 时，稍后在浏览器中打开这个地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1906":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-68","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#serve","content":"按 Ctrl+C 停止；退出时删除 `server.json`。没有构建好的 Web UI（源码安装而未构建）时，日志警告一句并只提供 API。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1907":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-69","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#check","content":"检查配置并报告会提供哪些渠道和账户，不启动服务器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1908":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-70","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#check","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"1909":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-71","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#check","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1910":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-72","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#check","content":"`--json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1911":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-73","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#check","content":"打印 JSON","locale":"zh-CN"},"1912":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-74","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#check","content":"检查的内容与 Web UI 保存设置时相同：网络策略和代理地址、端口范围、各项上限、Playground 设置，以及安全规则（例如监听非本机地址必须同时配置 `security.allow_cidrs` 和 `server.access_token`；`security.allow_origins` 需要 `server.access_token`）。有问题时以退出码 2 结束并说明原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1913":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-75","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands#check","content":"每个渠道写作 `<id>:<账户数>`，不需要账户的渠道在没有账户时标为 `(keyless)`。一个渠道都没有启用时打印一行错误，退出码为 2。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1914":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-76","page_id":"/do