","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#代理变量","content":"网络模式为 `auto`（默认）时，Hoshimi 对每个上游请求读取代理变量：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2076":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-62","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#代理变量","content":"`https://` 地址用 `HTTPS_PROXY`，`http://` 地址用 `HTTP_PROXY`；没有设置时用 `ALL_PROXY`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2077":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-63","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#代理变量","content":"`NO_PROXY` 中列出的主机直接连接：可以写主机名、域名后缀、带端口的主机、CIDR 网段，或 `*`（全部直连），用逗号或分号分隔。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2078":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-64","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#代理变量","content":"小写形式（`https_proxy` 等）优先于大写形式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2079":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-65","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#代理变量","content":"回环地址（本机）总是直接连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2080":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-66","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#代理变量","content":"代理地址必须是有效的 HTTP(S) 或 SOCKS5 URL；写错时会报错，而不是悄悄忽略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2081":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-67","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#代理变量","content":"没有任何代理变量时，在 Windows 上可以用 `network.system_proxy: true` 回退到系统代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2082":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-68","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#代理变量","content":"网络模式为 `direct`（直连）或 `proxy`（指定代理）时不读取这些变量，`NO_PROXY` 也只作用于自动模式。全局和单个渠道的网络设置见网络与代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2083":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-69","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#云-sdk-读取的变量","content":"两种云平台的认证方式交给官方 SDK，由 SDK 按它自己的规则读取环境变量：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2084":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-70","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#云-sdk-读取的变量","content":"**Vertex，`auth: \"adc\"`**：Google 的应用默认凭据（ADC），例如 `GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS` 指向的服务账户文件。需要 `hoshimi[google]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2085":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-71","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"