":"/docs/cli-15","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"`--debug`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2131":{"id":"/docs/cli-16","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"任意一级，例如 `hoshimi --debug check` 或 `hoshimi check --debug`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2132":{"id":"/docs/cli-17","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"打印调试日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"2133":{"id":"/docs/cli-18","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"`--help`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2134":{"id":"/docs/cli-19","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"任意一级","locale":"zh-CN"},"2135":{"id":"/docs/cli-20","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"显示帮助并退出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2136":{"id":"/docs/cli-21","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"`--install-completion`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2137":{"id":"/docs/cli-22","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"仅 `hoshimi`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2138":{"id":"/docs/cli-23","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"为当前 shell 安装命令补全","locale":"zh-CN"},"2139":{"id":"/docs/cli-24","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"`--show-completion`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2140":{"id":"/docs/cli-25","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"仅 `hoshimi`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2141":{"id":"/docs/cli-26","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"打印当前 shell 的补全脚本，便于复制或自行安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"2142":{"id":"/docs/cli-27","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令如何工作","content":"**所有命令共用同一份配置。** 每条命令都读取数据目录里的 `config.json`（路径由 `hoshimi config path` 打印），与当前工作目录无关。Web UI 读写的也是这个文件。数据目录可以用 `HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR` 换到别处，见环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2143":{"id":"/docs/cli-28","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令如何工作","content":"**不需要服务器在运行。** `check`、`models`、`providers`、`login`、`config` 等命令在自己的进程里按配置构建渠道，执行完就退出，不会连接正在运行的服务器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2144":{"id":"/docs/cli-29","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令如何工作","content":"**修改要重启才对运行中的服务器生效。** `hoshimi config set` 和 `hoshimi login` 只写入 `config.json`；正在运行的服务器不会重新读取文件。修改后重启服务器，或者直接在 Web UI 的 **设置** 和 **渠道** 页修改，那里的修改立即生效（监听地址和端口除外）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2145":{"id":"/docs/cli-30","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令如何工作","content":"**`serve` 的选项只作用于这一次启动。** 例如 `hoshimi serve --port 11000 --access-token …` 不会写入配置文件。优先级为：`serve` 的选项 ＞ `config.json` ＞ 默认值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2146":{"id":"/docs/cli-31","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"列表类命令默认打印表格；加 `--json` 打印 JSON，适合脚本处理。支持 `--json` 的命令：`check`、`models`、`providers`、`stations`、`version`、`env`、`config show`。`config get` 总是打印 JSON。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2147":{"id":"/docs/cli-32","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"数据写到标准输出，日志和错误写到标准错误，所以管道里只会得到数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2148":{"id":"/docs/cli-33","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"读取配置的命令会隐藏凭据：`config show` 和 `config get` 把 `server.access_token`、`server.model_api_key`，以及渠道和网络设置中的 API Key、令牌、密钥和代理地址显示为 `***`；`env` 把名字中含 `TOKEN` 或 `KEY` 的变量值显示为 `***`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2149":{"id":"/docs/cli-34","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"2150":{"id":"/docs/cli-35","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"2151":{"id":"/docs/cli-36","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`0`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2152":{"id":"/docs/cli-37","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"成功","locale":"zh-CN"},"2153":{"id":"/docs/cli-38","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2154":{"id":"/docs/cli-39","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"一般错误：命令失败、被取消、登录失败或超时、配置文件无法读取","locale":"zh-CN"},"2155":{"id":"/docs/cli-40","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2156":{"id":"/docs/cli-41","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"用法错误或无效值（未知选项、`config set` 的值没有通过检查）；`check` 发现没有启用任何渠道；`login` 的站点不支持交互登录；没有子命令时显示帮助","locale":"zh-CN"},"2157":{"id":"/docs/cli-42","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`3`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2158":{"id":"/docs/cli-43","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`serve` 找不到可用端口（或在 `--strict-port` 下端口被占用）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2159":{"id":"/docs/cli-44","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`4`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2160":{"id":"/docs/cli-45","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"输入无效：`config get` 的键不存在；`serve` 监听非本机地址但没有配置工具访问密钥或允许的网段","locale":"zh-CN"},"2161":{"id":"/docs/cli-46","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2162":{"id":"/docs/cli-47","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"上游服务出错","locale":"zh-CN"},"2163":{"id":"/docs/cli-48","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`130`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2164":{"id":"/docs/cli-49","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"被 Ctrl+C 中断","locale":"zh-CN"},"2165":{"id":"/docs/cli-50","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`serve` 运行时按 Ctrl+C 会正常关闭服务器：先结束实时用量等长连接，再退出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2166":{"id":"/docs/cli-51","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#日志","content":"日志写到标准错误。默认级别是 `INFO`；`--debug` 打开调试日志，环境变量 `HOSHIMI_LOG_LEVEL` 可以设为 `DEBUG`、`INFO`、`WARNING` 或 `ERROR`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2167":{"id":"/docs/cli-52","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#配置文件损坏时","content":"`config.json` 无法解析时，所有读取配置的命令（包括 `serve`）都会拒绝运行，并在出错前把原文件复制一份为 `config.json.corrupt-<时间>`，错误信息里会给出这个副本的路径。修好或删除 `config.json` 后再试。文件位置和格式见配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2168":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","type":"page","content":"Anthropic SDK","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","接入客户端"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-anthropic","locale":"zh-CN"},"2169":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-0","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic","content":"用 Anthropic 的 Python、TypeScript SDK 和 curl 调用 Hoshimi 的 Messages 接口：非流式与流式、工具调用、思考与推理强度、Token 计数，以及原生转发与协议转换的区别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2170":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-1","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"连接参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2171":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-2","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#python","content":"Python","locale":"zh-CN"},"2172":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-3","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#流式","content":"流式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2173":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-4","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#工具调用","content":"工具调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2174":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-5","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#思考与推理强度","content":"思考与推理强度","locale":"zh-CN"},"2175":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-6","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#token-计数","content":"Token 计数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2176":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-7","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#typescript","content":"TypeScript","locale":"zh-CN"},"2177":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-8","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#curl","content":"curl","locale":"zh-CN"},"2178":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-9","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#原生转发与协议转换","content":"原生转发与协议转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"2179":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-10","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#错误","content":"错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"2180":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-11","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic","content":"Hoshimi 的 `/v1/messages` 兼容 Anthropic Messages，Anthropic 官方 SDK 只需改 Base URL。模型目录与 OpenAI 接口共用，任何模型都可以通过 Messages 调用。本页示例都在本机实测过；`<model-id>` 换成 `GET /v1/models` 返回的 `id`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2181":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-12","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2182":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-13","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2183":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-14","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"Base URL","locale":"zh-CN"},"2184":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-15","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"`http://127.0.0.1:10600`（不带 `/v1`，SDK 会自己拼上 `/v1/messages`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2185":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-16","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"API Key","locale":"zh-CN"},"2186":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-17","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"网关的模型 API 密钥，作为 `x-api-key` 或 `Authorization: Bearer` 发送；没有设置时填任意非空字符串","locale":"zh-CN"},"2187":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-18","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2188":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-19","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"`/v1/models` 中的 `id`，或 `渠道/模型`；Messages 必须写明，不使用默认模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2189":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-20","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"SDK 的 `api_key` 参数发送 `x-api-key`，`auth_token` 参数发送 `Authorization: Bearer`，两种 Hoshimi 都接受。两者同时出现时以 `Authorization` 为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2190":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-21","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#python","content":"`max_tokens` 是必填项。和 Anthropic 一样，不写 `stream` 时返回完整的 JSON。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2191":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-22","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#流式","content":"SDK 的流式辅助方法可以直接使用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2192":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-23","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#流式","content":"等待上游时，Hoshimi 每 15 秒在完整事件之间插入一个 `ping` 事件，SDK 会自动忽略它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2193":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-24","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#工具调用","content":"`tool_choice` 可以是 `{\"type\": \"auto\"}`、`{\"type\": \"any\"}`、`{\"type\": \"none\"}`，或 `{\"type\": \"tool\", \"name\": \"...\"}`（名字必须是声明过的工具）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2194":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-25","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#工具调用","content":"工具结果放在下一条用户消息里，`tool_use_id` 对应上一轮的调用；`tool_result` 块要放在这条消息中的文字和图片之前。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2195":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-26","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#工具调用","content":"把上一轮的 `reply.content` 原样放回 `assistant` 消息，其中的思考块和签名也要保留（见下文）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2196":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-27","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#思考与推理强度","content":"两种写法都可以：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2197":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-28","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#思考与推理强度","content":"`thinking.type` 可以是 `enabled`、`disabled`、`adaptive`。`enabled` 的 `budget_tokens` 至少 1024，且小于 `max_tokens`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2198":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-29","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#思考与推理强度","content":"`output_config.effort` 可以是 `low`、`medium`、`high`、`xhigh`、`max`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2199":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-30","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#思考与推理强度","content":"上游不说 Anthropic 协议时，这些设置会换算成该模型支持的推理强度，换算规则见 Anthropic 兼容接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2200":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-31","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#思考与推理强度","content":"多轮对话中，要把助手消息里的 `thinking` / `redacted_thinking` 块连同原始 `signature` 一起发回。不要编辑或伪造签名，也不要把一个模型的签名拿给另一个模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2201":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-32","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#token-计数","content":"上游提供原生计数接口时（Anthropic 账号默认如此）返回的是上游的计数；否则返回 Hoshimi 的本地估算，响应头带 `x-hoshimi-token-count: estimate`。估算按请求内容的 UTF-8 字节数近似，不调用分词器。计数不生成回复，也不记入用量统计。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2202":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-33","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#curl","content":"加上 `\"stream\": true` 得到 SSE（配合 `curl -N`）。没有设置模型 API 密钥时可以省略 `x-api-key`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2203":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-34","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#原生转发与协议转换","content":"Hoshimi 按请求实际落到的账号决定怎么处理：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2204":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-35","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#原生转发与协议转换","content":"**原生转发**：账号所在的渠道本身提供 Messages 接口（例如 `anthropic`），请求只替换模型名后原样转发，系统提示数组、内容顺序、签名、缓存标记、`context_management`、结构化输出以及将来的新字段都交给上游校验；`anthropic-*` 请求头和查询参数也会带上。上游的错误（状态码、响应体、`request-id`、`retry-after`、`anthropic-ratelimit-*` 等头）原样返回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2205":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-36","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#原生转发与协议转换","content":"**协议转换**：其他渠道先把 Messages 转换成内部的 Chat 格式。文字、图片、系统提示、工具、思考都能转换，但只有原生上游才支持的功能（MCP 连接器、容器、`context_management`、服务器端工具、`task_budget`、非文本文档等）会返回 `400`，消息中写明是哪个字段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2206":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-37","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#原生转发与协议转换","content":"两种路径的完整差异见 Anthropic 兼容接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2207":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-38","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#错误","content":"Messages 的错误使用 Anthropic 的格式，SDK 会抛出对应的异常（如 `anthropic.NotFoundError`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2208":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-39","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#错误","content":"流式请求在发出响应头之前会先打开上游，所以认证失败、限流这类错误仍然带着正确的 HTTP 状态码返回；流开始后的失败以 `error` 事件告知。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2209":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"page","content":"Claude Code","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","接入客户端"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code","locale":"zh-CN"},"2210":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-0","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code","content":"让 Claude Code 通过 Hoshimi 调用模型：设置 ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL 和密钥、选择模型与后台模型、模型发现，以及经过协议转换的上游目前的限制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2211":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-1","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#配置步骤","content":"配置步骤","locale":"zh-CN"},"2212":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-2","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#准备模型和密钥","content":"准备模型和密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"2213":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-3","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#设置环境变量并启动","content":"设置环境变量并启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"2214":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-4","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#固定后台模型","content":"固定后台模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2215":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-5","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#写进-settingsjson","content":"写进 settings.json","locale":"zh-CN"},"2216":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-6","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#模型发现","content":"模型发现","locale":"zh-CN"},"2217":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-7","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"相关环境变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"2218":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-8","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#claude-code-的请求如何被处理","content":"Claude Code 的请求如何被处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2219":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-9","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"排查","locale":"zh-CN"},"2220":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-10","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code","content":"Claude Code 说的是 Anthropic Messages 协议，把它的 Base URL 指向 Hoshimi，它的请求就会走 Hoshimi 的 `/v1/messages`。用的是网关的模型 API 密钥，上游账号的凭据留在 Hoshimi 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2221":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-11","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code","content":"模型所在的渠道本身提供 Messages 接口时（例如 `anthropic` 渠道），Hoshimi 只替换模型名后原样转发，Claude Code 的各种请求字段都由上游处理。其他渠道的模型要经过协议转换，而较新的 Claude Code 会发送转换路径不支持的内容。在本地用 Claude Code 2.1.308（`claude -p`）测试时，经过转换的模型返回：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2222":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-12","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code","content":"`400 <渠道>: context_management requires a native Messages upstream.`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2223":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-13","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code","content":"设置 `CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_BETAS=1` 后：`400 <渠道>: Messages roles must be user or assistant; use top-level system.`（这个版本会在 `messages` 中放入 `system` 角色的消息）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2224":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-14","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code","content":"所以目前请为 Claude Code 选择原生 Messages 渠道上的模型。两条路径的差别见 Anthropic 兼容接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2225":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-15","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#准备模型和密钥","content":"启动 Hoshimi，在 **渠道** 页添加一个提供 Messages 接口的渠道账号（如 Anthropic 的 API Key），见渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2226":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-16","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#准备模型和密钥","content":"在 **模型** 页或用 `curl http://127.0.0.1:10600/v1/models` 找到模型 id。写成 `anthropic/<model-id>` 可以确保由这个渠道处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2227":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-17","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#准备模型和密钥","content":"如果设置了 **模型 API 密钥**（**设置** › **访问** › **密钥**），准备好它；没有设置时任意非空字符串都可以。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2228":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-18","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#设置环境变量并启动","content":"`ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL` 不带 `/v1`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2229":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-19","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#设置环境变量并启动","content":"`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` 以 `x-api-key` 发送。旧的 `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` 会以 `Authorization` 头发送，而 Hoshimi 在两者同时出现时以 `Authorization` 为准，所以要清掉它，或者干脆把模型 API 密钥填在 `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2230":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-20","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#设置环境变量并启动","content":"用的是 **模型 API 密钥**，不是工具访问密钥，也不是上游的 Anthropic Key。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2231":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-21","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#固定后台模型","content":"Claude Code 的后台请求使用 Haiku 别名，另外还有 Sonnet、Opus 两个别名。别名指向的模型 id 在 Hoshimi 中找不到时，请求会报路由错误。把 `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL` 指向网关里存在的模型，后台请求就会固定到它；用到 Sonnet、Opus 别名时也同样设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2232":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-22","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#写进-settingsjson","content":"不想每次设置环境变量时，可以写进 Claude Code 的用户设置 `~/.claude/settings.json` 的 `env` 中，`ANTHROPIC_MODEL` 代替 `--model`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2233":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-23","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#模型发现","content":"设置 `CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_GATEWAY_MODEL_DISCOVERY=1` 后，Claude Code 会向网关请求模型列表来填充模型选择器。Hoshimi 对它发出的 `GET /v1/models?limit=1000` 最多等待 2 秒：响应慢的渠道先用缓存、配置或内置的模型 id 顶上，发现在后台继续完成；每个条目带有 `display_name` 供显示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2234":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-24","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#模型发现","content":"Claude Code 的选择器只显示 id 中含 `claude` 或 `anthropic` 的模型。其他模型请用 `--model`、`ANTHROPIC_MODEL` 或上面的别名变量显式指定；Hoshimi 不会把其他模型改名伪装成 Claude。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2235":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-25","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"2236":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-26","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2237":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-27","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"`ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2238":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-28","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"网关地址，`http://127.0.0.1:10600`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2239":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-29","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2240":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-30","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"模型 API 密钥，以 `x-api-key` 发送","locale":"zh-CN"},"2241":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-31","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"`ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2242":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-32","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"以 `Authorization: Bearer` 发送；与上一项二选一，优先于它","locale":"zh-CN"},"2243":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-33","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"`ANTHROPIC_MODEL`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2244":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-34","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"默认主模型，等同 `--model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2245":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-35","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"`ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL` / `_SONNET_MODEL` / `_OPUS_MODEL`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2246":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-36","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"三个模型别名对应的网关模型 id","locale":"zh-CN"},"2247":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-37","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"`CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_GATEWAY_MODEL_DISCOVERY`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2248":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-38","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"设为 `1` 时从网关的 `/v1/models` 发现模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2249":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-39","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"`CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_BETAS`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2250":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-40","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"设为 `1` 时减少实验性 beta 功能，可用于排查上游不支持 beta 的问题；具体效果取决于 Claude Code 版本，它不会去掉所有 beta 头、推理强度或自适应思考，也不能代替原生转发","locale":"zh-CN"},"2251":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-41","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#claude-code-的请求如何被处理","content":"Claude Code 发送 `thinking: {\"type\": \"adaptive\"}` 和 `output_config.effort`。原生转发时原样交给上游；转换时换算成该模型的推理强度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2252":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-42","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#claude-code-的请求如何被处理","content":"原生转发保留 `anthropic-beta` 等 `anthropic-*` 请求头，并合并 OAuth 账号必需的 beta 能力；上游的限流头（`retry-after`、`anthropic-ratelimit-*`、`x-should-retry`）原样返回，Claude Code 可以据此重试。上游明确返回 `x-should-retry: false` 时，Hoshimi 也不会换账号重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2253":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-43","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#claude-code-的请求如何被处理","content":"流式响应在等待上游时每 15 秒插入一个 `ping` 事件，只出现在完整事件之间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2254":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-44","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#claude-code-的请求如何被处理","content":"Hoshimi 不保存对话历史，Claude Code 每轮都会发送完整历史。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2255":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-45","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#claude-code-的请求如何被处理","content":"Claude Code 遇到不认识的模型 id 时会提示它假定 200k 的上下文窗口，这只是 Claude Code 自己的提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2256":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-46","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"现象","locale":"zh-CN"},"2257":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-47","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"原因与处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2258":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-48","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"`401`，`A model API key is required`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2259":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-49","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"设置了模型 API 密钥但没有发送，或 `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` 中是旧值覆盖了 `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2260":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-50","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"`404`，`Model '…' not found`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2261":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-51","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"主模型或某个别名指向的 id 不在目录中；检查 `--model` 和三个 `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_*_MODEL`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2262":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-52","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"`400`，`… requires a native Messages upstream` 或 `Messages roles must be user or assistant`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2263":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-53","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"模型经过协议转换，见本页开头","locale":"zh-CN"},"2264":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-54","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"连接被拒绝或 `Host not allowed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2265":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-55","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"端口不是 10600（看服务器启动时打印的地址），或从另一台机器、容器访问，见访问控制","locale":"zh-CN"},"2266":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-56","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"每次调用（包括失败的）都会出现在 **用量** 页，可以在那里看到错误信息和实际使用的渠道与账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2267":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"page","content":"Codex","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","接入客户端"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex","locale":"zh-CN"},"2268":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-0","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex","content":"在 Codex CLI 的 config.toml 中把 Hoshimi 添加为模型提供方，通过 Responses 接口使用网关里的任意模型；包括推理强度、工具调用和常见问题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2269":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-1","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex#配置","content":"配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2270":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-2","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex#找到模型-id","content":"找到模型 id","locale":"zh-CN"},"2271":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-3","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex#编辑-configtoml","content":"编辑 config.toml","locale":"zh-CN"},"2272":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-4","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex#设置密钥并运行","content":"设置密钥并运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2273":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-5","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex#推理强度","content":"推理强度","locale":"zh-CN"},"2274":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-6","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex#工具调用","content":"工具调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2275":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-7","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"常见问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"2276":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-8","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex","content":"Codex CLI 通过 OpenAI Responses 协议调用模型，可以在配置里添加自定义的模型提供方。把 Hoshimi 添加进去后，Codex 就能使用网关目录中的任何模型：Hoshimi 把 Responses 请求转换成上游各自的协议。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2277":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-9","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex","content":"本页讲的是把 Codex CLI 作为客户端接到 Hoshimi。Hoshimi 自己也有一个名为 `codex` 的渠道，用 ChatGPT 账号登录后把 Codex 的模型提供给网关，那是另一回事，见渠道概念。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2278":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-10","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#找到模型-id","content":"在 **模型** 页或用 `curl http://127.0.0.1:10600/v1/models` 选一个支持工具调用的模型。Codex 会大量使用工具，**模型** 页标有 **工具调用** 的模型更合适。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2279":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-11","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#编辑-configtoml","content":"Codex 的配置在 `~/.codex/config.toml`（设置了 `CODEX_HOME` 时在该目录下）。添加一个提供方并设为默认：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2280":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-12","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#编辑-configtoml","content":"`base_url` 带 `/v1`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2281":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-13","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#编辑-configtoml","content":"`env_key` 是保存密钥的环境变量名，Codex 把它的值以 `Authorization: Bearer` 发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2282":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-14","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#编辑-configtoml","content":"`wire_api = \"responses\"` 让 Codex 调用 `/v1/responses`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2283":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-15","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#设置密钥并运行","content":"临时换模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2284":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-16","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#推理强度","content":"在 `config.toml` 中设置，或在命令行上用 `-c` 覆盖：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2285":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-17","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#推理强度","content":"Codex 以 `reasoning.effort` 发送，Hoshimi 换算成该模型自己的级别，规则见 OpenAI 兼容接口。模型的推理内容会作为 `reasoning` 项返回，Codex 显示为思考过程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2286":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-18","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#工具调用","content":"Codex 的命令执行等工具都是 `function` 类型，Hoshimi 会转换后交给上游，模型发出的调用再转换回 Codex。Codex 同时发送的 `web_search` 等内置工具和 `namespace` 类型的工具不是 `function`，Hoshimi 会忽略它们，模型看不到这些工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2287":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-19","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#工具调用","content":"Codex 每一轮都发送完整的 `input` 并设置 `store: false`，正好符合 Hoshimi 无状态的 Responses 接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2288":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-20","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"现象","locale":"zh-CN"},"2289":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-21","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"2290":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-22","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"`Model metadata for '<id>' not found. Defaulting to fallback metadata`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2291":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-23","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"Codex 不认识这个模型名时打印的警告，请求照常发送","locale":"zh-CN"},"2292":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-24","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"`stream disconnected before completion: stream closed before response.completed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2293":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-25","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"流开始后上游返回了错误，Hoshimi 用错误事件结束了流，Codex 重连几次后放弃。打开 **用量** 页查看这次调用的错误信息。在本地测试中，同样的工具调用任务有的模型能完成，有的模型在第二轮被上游以 `HTTP 400` 拒绝，换一个模型通常可以解决","locale":"zh-CN"},"2294":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-26","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"`401`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2295":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-27","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"设置了模型 API 密钥，但 `env_key` 指向的环境变量为空或值不对","locale":"zh-CN"},"2296":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-28","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"`404`，`Model '…' not found`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2297":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-29","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"`model` 不在目录中；可以写成 `渠道/模型` 指定渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"2298":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-30","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"`400`，`previous_response_id`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2299":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-31","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"不会出现在 Codex 的默认配置中；Hoshimi 不保存响应，见接入客户端","locale":"zh-CN"},"2300":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","type":"page","content":"OpenAI SDK 与 curl","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","接入客户端"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-openai","locale":"zh-CN"},"2301":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-0","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai","content":"用 OpenAI 的 Python、JavaScript SDK 和 curl 调用 Hoshimi 的 Chat Completions 与 Responses：非流式与流式、推理内容、推理强度、工具调用、图片和错误处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2302":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-1","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"连接参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2303":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-2","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-openai#python","content":"Python","locale":"zh-CN"},"2304":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-3","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-openai#非流式","content":"非流式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2305":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-4","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-openai#流式","content":"流式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2306":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-5","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-openai#推理内容与推理强度","content":"推理内容与推理强度","locale":"zh-CN"},"2307":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-6","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-openai#工具调用","content":"工具调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2308":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-7","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-openai#图片","content":"图片","locale":"zh-CN"},"2309":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-8","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-openai#responses","content":"Responses","locale":"zh-CN"},"2310":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-9","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-openai#javascript--typescript","content":"JavaScript / TypeScript","locale":"zh-CN"},"2311":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-10","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-openai#curl","content":"curl","locale":"zh-CN"},"2312":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-11","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-openai#错误处理","content":"错误处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2313":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-12","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai","content":"OpenAI 的官方 SDK 只要换掉 Base URL 就能直接调用 Hoshimi。本页的示例都在本机实测过；把 `<model-id>` 换成 `GET /v1/models` 返回的某个 `id`（见接入客户端）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2314":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-13","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2315":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-14","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2316":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-15","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"Base URL","locale":"zh-CN"},"2317":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-16","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"`http://127.0.0.1:10600/v1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2318":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-17","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"API Key","locale":"zh-CN"},"2319":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-18","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"网关的模型 API 密钥；没有设置时填任意非空字符串","locale":"zh-CN"},"2320":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-19","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2321":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-20","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"`/v1/models` 中的 `id`，或 `渠道/模型`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2322":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-21","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"示例从环境变量读取密钥：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2323":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-22","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#非流式","content":"Hoshimi 在请求没有 `stream` 字段时默认流式返回。SDK 在不传 `stream` 时不会发送这个字段，`create()` 会返回一段 SSE 原文（`str`）而不是对象。Responses 的 `client.responses.create()` 也一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2324":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-23","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#流式","content":"流中有一个 `choices` 为空、只带 `usage` 的块（上游报告了用量时），不需要设置 `stream_options`；所以循环里要先判断 `chunk.choices`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2325":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-24","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#推理内容与推理强度","content":"推理模型的思考过程放在 `reasoning_content` 字段，SDK 把它作为附加属性保留：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2326":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-25","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#推理内容与推理强度","content":"流式时从 `chunk.choices[0].delta` 上用 `getattr(delta, \"reasoning_content\", None)` 读取。`reasoning_effort` 可以写 `minimal`、`low`、`medium`、`high`、`xhigh`、`max`，也可以写模型自己的级别名；各模型的级别见 **模型** 页，映射规则见 OpenAI 兼容接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2327":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-26","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#工具调用","content":"`tool_choice` 可以是 `auto`、`none`、`required` 或指定某个函数。每一轮都要把完整的 `messages` 发回去，Hoshimi 不保存历史。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2328":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-27","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#图片","content":"图片作为 `image_url` 内容块发送，可以是 `data:` URL：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2329":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-28","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#图片","content":"只有能看图的模型会理解图片，**模型** 页的 **视觉** 标记说明了这一点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2330":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-29","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#responses","content":"流式时用 `stream=True` 逐个读取事件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2331":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-30","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#responses","content":"Hoshimi 的 Responses 事件流不发送 `response.content_part.added` 等内容分段事件，Python SDK 的 `client.responses.stream()` 辅助方法依赖这些事件，会抛出 `IndexError`。请改用上面的 `responses.create(..., stream=True)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2332":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-31","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#responses","content":"Responses 的工具调用循环：把上一轮的全部 `output` 项和 `function_call_output` 一起放回 `input`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2333":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-32","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#responses","content":"Responses 是无状态的：`previous_response_id` 和结构化输出 `text.format` 会被拒绝（`400`），只接受 `type: \"function\"` 的工具。完整的字段说明见 OpenAI 兼容接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2334":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-33","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#javascript--typescript","content":"和 Python 一样，不写 `stream` 时 `create()` 返回的是 SSE 原文字符串。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2335":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-34","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#curl","content":"非流式：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2336":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-35","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#curl","content":"流式（`-N` 关闭 curl 的缓冲）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2337":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-36","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#curl","content":"每个事件是一行 `data: {...}`，最后是 `data: [DONE]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2338":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-37","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#curl","content":"Responses：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2339":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-38","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#curl","content":"没有设置模型 API 密钥时可以省略 `Authorization` 头，`x-api-key: <密钥>` 也可以代替它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2340":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-39","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#curl","content":"在 Playground 里，回复的 **更多操作** 菜单中的 **复制为 API 请求** 会把这条回复背后的 Chat Completions 请求复制成一条 curl 命令，密钥从 `$HOSHIMI_API_KEY` 读取，可以直接作为起点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2341":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-40","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#错误处理","content":"`/v1` 的错误使用 OpenAI 的格式，SDK 会抛出对应的异常（如 `openai.NotFoundError`、`openai.BadRequestError`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2342":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-41","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#错误处理","content":"流式响应开始之后，上游的失败不能再改变 HTTP 状态码：Chat Completions 会发出一个 `data: {\"error\": {...}}` 事件并结束（没有 `data: [DONE]`），Responses 发出 `response.failed` 事件或同样的 `error` 事件。失败的调用会记录在 **用量** 页，可以在那里查看错误信息。错误码的完整列表见 API 概览。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2343":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","type":"page","content":"OpenCode","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","接入客户端"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-opencode","locale":"zh-CN"},"2344":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-0","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode","content":"在 opencode.json 中把 Hoshimi 添加为 OpenAI 兼容的提供方，让 OpenCode 使用网关里的模型；包括密钥、模型列表、推理强度，以及它和 Hoshimi 的 OpenCode Zen 渠道的区别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2345":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-1","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-opencode#配置","content":"配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2346":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-2","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-opencode#写-opencodejson","content":"写 opencode.json","locale":"zh-CN"},"2347":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-3","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-opencode#设置密钥并运行","content":"设置密钥并运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2348":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-4","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-opencode#推理强度","content":"推理强度","locale":"zh-CN"},"2349":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-5","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-opencode#工具调用","content":"工具调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2350":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-6","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-opencode#通过-opencode-zen-渠道使用免费模型","content":"通过 OpenCode Zen 渠道使用免费模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2351":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-7","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode","content":"OpenCode 可以通过 `@ai-sdk/openai-compatible` 接入任何 OpenAI 兼容的服务。把 Hoshimi 配置成一个提供方后，OpenCode 用 Chat Completions 调用网关，网关再把请求转给各个渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2352":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-8","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode","content":"本页讲的是把 OpenCode 这个编程助手作为客户端接到 Hoshimi。Hoshimi 自带的 `opencode` 渠道是反过来的：它连接 OpenCode Zen 的免费模型，提供给网关的所有客户端使用，见匿名入口。两者可以同时使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2353":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-9","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#写-opencodejson","content":"在项目根目录的 `opencode.json`（只对这个项目生效）或全局配置 `~/.config/opencode/opencode.json` 中添加：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2354":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-10","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#写-opencodejson","content":"`baseURL` 带 `/v1`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2355":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-11","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#写-opencodejson","content":"`apiKey` 用 `{env:HOSHIMI_API_KEY}` 从环境变量读取模型 API 密钥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2356":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-12","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#写-opencodejson","content":"`models` 中的键是 Hoshimi 的模型 id（`/v1/models` 中的 `id`，或 `渠道/模型`），值里的 `name` 是 OpenCode 中显示的名字。列在这里的模型会出现在 OpenCode 的模型列表中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2357":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-13","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#写-opencodejson","content":"顶层的 `model` 是默认模型，格式为 `提供方/模型`，这里的提供方是 `hoshimi`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2358":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-14","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#设置密钥并运行","content":"单次运行或换模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2359":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-15","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#推理强度","content":"在模型的 `options` 中设置 `reasoningEffort`，OpenCode 会以 `reasoning_effort` 发送：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2360":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-16","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#推理强度","content":"可以写 `low`、`medium`、`high` 等，也可以写模型自己的级别名；Hoshimi 的换算规则见 OpenAI 兼容接口，各模型的级别见 **模型** 页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2361":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-17","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#工具调用","content":"OpenCode 的读文件、搜索、执行命令等工具以 Chat Completions 的 `function` 工具发送，模型的调用原样转换回 OpenCode 执行。选择 **模型** 页标有 **工具调用** 的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2362":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-18","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#通过-opencode-zen-渠道使用免费模型","content":"用 Hoshimi 默认启用的 `opencode` 渠道上的模型（如 `/v1/models` 中 `owned_by` 为 `opencode` 的那些）时，有两点和客户端有关：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2363":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-19","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#通过-opencode-zen-渠道使用免费模型","content":"匿名通道会按对话生成会话 ID，来源依次是请求体中的 `session_id`、`conversation_id`、`user`，都没有时取第一条用户消息。两个以相同开场白开始的独立对话会共用会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2364":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-20","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#通过-opencode-zen-渠道使用免费模型","content":"匿名通道会额外声明上游要求的 `read`、`shell` 两个工具。客户端没有声明的工具，模型调用了也不会交给客户端：Hoshimi 会告诉模型这个工具不可用并让它继续回答。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2365":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-21","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#通过-opencode-zen-渠道使用免费模型","content":"渠道本身的协议细节、匿名与 API Key 账号的区别见匿名入口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2366":{"id":"/docs/clients","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"page","content":"接入客户端","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","接入客户端"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients","locale":"zh-CN"},"2367":{"id":"/docs/clients-0","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients","content":"把 SDK、curl 或编程助手接到 Hoshimi 需要知道的事：Base URL、用哪把密钥、模型名怎么写、选哪种 API，以及流式、推理强度和工具调用的约定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2368":{"id":"/docs/clients-1","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"需要准备的三样东西","locale":"zh-CN"},"2369":{"id":"/docs/clients-2","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"2370":{"id":"/docs/clients-3","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"模型名","locale":"zh-CN"},"2371":{"id":"/docs/clients-4","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"选择哪种 API","locale":"zh-CN"},"2372":{"id":"/docs/clients-5","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#流式输出","content":"流式输出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2373":{"id":"/docs/clients-6","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#无状态","content":"无状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"2374":{"id":"/docs/clients-7","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":