zh-CN"},"2410":{"id":"/docs/clients-43","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"先列出可用的模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2411":{"id":"/docs/clients-44","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"`id` 是上游自己的模型名，`owned_by` 是提供它的渠道。请求里的 `model` 有两种写法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2412":{"id":"/docs/clients-45","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"**直接写 `id`**，如 `big-pickle`。Hoshimi 按渠道顺序找第一个提供这个模型的渠道。只启用了一个渠道时，目录里没有的模型名也会原样发给它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2413":{"id":"/docs/clients-46","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"**写成 `渠道/模型`**，如 `opencode/big-pickle`，指定由哪个渠道处理。第一个斜杠后面的全部内容作为上游模型名发送，可以再含斜杠，例如 `kilo/kilo-auto/free`。几个渠道提供同名模型时，用这种写法选择其中一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2414":{"id":"/docs/clients-47","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"请求不写 `model` 时，Chat Completions 和 Responses 使用 **设置** › **常规** 中的 **默认模型**（配置键 `server.default_model`，或 `hoshimi serve --default-model`）。Messages 接口始终要求写明 `model`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2415":{"id":"/docs/clients-48","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"每个模型能否看图、是否推理、能否调用工具、有哪些推理强度，在 **模型** 页可以看到，见模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2416":{"id":"/docs/clients-49","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"API","locale":"zh-CN"},"2417":{"id":"/docs/clients-50","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"2418":{"id":"/docs/clients-51","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"适合","locale":"zh-CN"},"2419":{"id":"/docs/clients-52","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"Chat Completions","locale":"zh-CN"},"2420":{"id":"/docs/clients-53","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"t