 一致：默认返回 JSON，`\"stream\": true` 时返回 SSE。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2431":{"id":"/docs/clients-64","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#无状态","content":"Hoshimi 不保存对话。每次请求都要带上完整的历史：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2432":{"id":"/docs/clients-65","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#无状态","content":"Chat Completions 和 Messages 发送全部 `messages`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2433":{"id":"/docs/clients-66","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#无状态","content":"Responses 发送全部 `input`；`previous_response_id` 会被拒绝（`400`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2434":{"id":"/docs/clients-67","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#无状态","content":"Playground 的对话保存在服务器上，但那是网页界面自己的接口，见 Playground API。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2435":{"id":"/docs/clients-68","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"三种 API 各有自己的字段，Hoshimi 都能读懂：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2436":{"id":"/docs/clients-69","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"API","locale":"zh-CN"},"2437":{"id":"/docs/clients-70","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"2438":{"id":"/docs/clients-71","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2439":{"id":"/docs/clients-72","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"Chat Completions","locale":"zh-CN"},"2440":{"id":"/docs/clients-73","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`reasoning_effort`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2441":{"id":"/docs/clients-74","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`\"reasoning_effort\": \"high\"`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2442":{"id":"/docs/clients-75","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"Responses","locale":"zh-CN"},"2443":{"id":"/docs/clients-76","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`reasoning.effort`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2444":{"id":"/docs/clients-77","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`\"reasoning\": {\"effort\": \"low\"}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2445":{"id":"/docs/clients-78","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"Messages","locale":"zh-CN"},"2446":{"id":"/docs/clients-79","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`output_config.effort` 或 `thinking`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2447":{"id":"/docs/clients-80","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`\"output_config\": {\"effort\": \"medium\"}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2448":{"id":"/docs/clients-81","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"不同模型的推理选项不同。自带推理菜单的模型（例如 `disabled` / `low` / `high` / `max`）直接使用对应的级别；其余推理模型使用 Hoshimi 的三档输出预算 `light` / `balanced` / `deep`，OpenAI 的 `minimal`、`low`、`medium`、`high` 等会被映射过去。请求里不写推理强度时，Hoshimi 不改动请求。映射规则见 OpenAI 兼容接口，三档预算的含义见模型与账号行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2449":{"id":"/docs/clients-82","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"工具由客户端执行，Hoshimi 只负责在协议之间转换工具定义、调用和结果：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2450":{"id":"/docs/clients-83","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"Chat Completions：`tools` 中的 `function` 工具，回复里的 `tool_calls`，结果用 `role: \"tool\"` 消息发回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2451":{"id":"/docs/clients-84","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"Responses：`type: \"function\"` 的工具，回复里的 `function_call` 项，结果用 `function_call_output` 项发回。其他类型的工具会被忽略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2452":{"id":"/docs/clients-85","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"Messages：带 `input_schema` 的工具，回复里的 `tool_use` 块，结果用 `tool_result` 块发回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2453":{"id":"/docs/clients-86","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"具体示例见各客户端页面。模型是否真的会调用工具取决于上游，**模型** 页的能力标记可供参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2454":{"id":"/docs/clients-87","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#从其他机器或容器连接","content":"默认只监听 `127.0.0.1`，而且只接受 `Host` 为 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1` 或 `::1` 的请求，所以从另一台机器或容器里访问（例如通过 `host.docker.internal`）会被拒绝。网页里运行的客户端还会受到来源检查。需要时按访问控制设置监听地址、**允许的 CIDR**、**允许的主机名** 和 **允许的来源**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2455":{"id":"/docs/clients-88","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"OpenAI SDK 与 curl\" href=\"/docs/clients-openai\" description=\"Python、JavaScript 和 curl：Chat Completions 与 Responses，流式、推理和工具调用。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2456":{"id":"/docs/clients-89","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"Anthropic SDK\" href=\"/docs/clients-anthropic\" description=\"用 Anthropic SDK 调用 Messages：流式、工具、思考和 Token 计数。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2457":{"id":"/docs/clients-90","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"Claude Code\" href=\"/docs/clients-claude-code\" description=\"ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL 等环境变量、模型别名和已知限制。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2458":{"id":"/docs/clients-91","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"Codex\" href=\"/docs/clients-codex\" description=\"在 config.toml 中添加 Hoshimi 作为模型提供方。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2459":{"id":"/docs/clients-92","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"OpenCode\" href=\"/docs/clients-opencode\" description=\"在 opencode.json 中添加 OpenAI 兼容的提供方。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2460":{"id":"/docs/clients-93","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[