config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network","content":"Hoshimi 向上游发出的请求（拉取模型目录、推理、登录、刷新令牌、查余额、签到）都按一条网络策略选择线路：直连，或经过某个代理。全局有一条默认策略，每个渠道可以单独覆盖。本页说明这些策略怎么写、怎么生效，以及出问题时去哪里看。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2472":{"id":"/docs/config-network-10","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network","content":"浏览器里打开的登录页面不受这些设置影响，它们使用浏览器自己的网络配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2473":{"id":"/docs/config-network-11","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2474":{"id":"/docs/config-network-12","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"行为","locale":"zh-CN"},"2475":{"id":"/docs/config-network-13","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"`auto`（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2476":{"id":"/docs/config-network-14","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"读取环境变量 `HTTPS_PROXY`、`HTTP_PROXY`、`ALL_PROXY` 和 `NO_PROXY` 决定是否走代理；都没有设置时直连","locale":"zh-CN"},"2477":{"id":"/docs/config-network-15","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"`direct`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2478":{"id":"/docs/config-network-16","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"始终直连，忽略环境变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"2479":{"id":"/docs/config-network-17","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"`proxy`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2480":{"id":"/docs/config-network-18","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"始终经过 `proxy` 中的代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2481":{"id":"/docs/config-network-19","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#三种模式","content":"`inherit`（仅渠道）","locale":"zh-CN"}