s@proxy.example.com:8080`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2492":{"id":"/docs/config-network-30","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#设置全局策略","content":"代理地址可能含有密码。它明文保存在本地的 `config.json` 中；设置接口只返回“是否已配置”，`hoshimi config show` 显示为 `***`，网页上显示 **已配置代理，保存可替换。** 在网页上清空代理地址并保存，会回到自动模式（渠道则回到继承）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2493":{"id":"/docs/config-network-31","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`auto` 模式按目标地址的协议选择代理：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2494":{"id":"/docs/config-network-32","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`https://` 目标用 `HTTPS_PROXY`，`http://` 目标用 `HTTP_PROXY`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2495":{"id":"/docs/config-network-33","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"对应的变量为空时用 `ALL_PROXY`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2496":{"id":"/docs/config-network-34","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"目标命中 `NO_PROXY` 时直连。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2497":{"id":"/docs/config-network-35","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"每个变量都是小写形式优先（`https_proxy` 优先于 `HTTPS_PROXY`）。环境变量里的代理地址同样会被校验，写错时请求会报错，而不是被悄悄忽略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2498":{"id":"/docs/config-network-36","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"`NO_PROXY` 用逗号（或分号）分隔，每一项可以是：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2499":{"id":"/docs/config-network-37","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"写法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2500":{"id":"/docs/config-network-38","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#环境变量auto-模式","content":"匹配","locale":"zh-CN"},"2501":{"id":"/docs/config-network-39","page_id":"/docs/config-network","ta