签到）、`request`（其他请求）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2541":{"id":"/docs/config-network-79","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"`route` 的取值：`direct`（直连）、`configured_proxy`（配置的代理）、`environment_proxy`（环境变量代理）、`system_proxy`（Windows 系统代理）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2542":{"id":"/docs/config-network-80","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"`kind` 的取值和含义：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2543":{"id":"/docs/config-network-81","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"`kind`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2544":{"id":"/docs/config-network-82","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"界面显示","locale":"zh-CN"},"2545":{"id":"/docs/config-network-83","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"2546":{"id":"/docs/config-network-84","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"`ok`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2547":{"id":"/docs/config-network-85","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"成功","locale":"zh-CN"},"2548":{"id":"/docs/config-network-86","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"请求成功","locale":"zh-CN"},"2549":{"id":"/docs/config-network-87","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"`timeout`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2550":{"id":"/docs/config-network-88","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"连接超时","locale":"zh-CN"},"2551":{"id":"/docs/config-network-89","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"连接或读取超时","locale":"zh-CN"},"2552":{"id":"/docs/confi