docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#数据库结构的升级","content":"此时旧版本仍可运行，但部分记录可能显示不正确。降级前先备份数据目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2663":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-70","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#日志","content":"Hoshimi 不写日志文件，所有日志都输出到标准错误（stderr）。服务器开始监听后，标准输出会打印一行 `SERVER_READY url=http://…`，方便脚本获取实际地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2664":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-71","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#日志","content":"作为系统服务运行时，日志由服务管理器收集（如 `journalctl`），见安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2665":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-72","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#移动配置文件","content":"旧版本的 `--config` 参数和 `HOSHIMI_CONFIG` 环境变量已经移除，当前工作目录下的 `config.json` 既不会被读取，也不会被自动迁移。升级后先运行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2666":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-73","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#移动配置文件","content":"在启动新版本之前，把旧的配置文件移动到它打印的位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2667":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-74","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#让旧的-json-记录自动导入","content":"更早的版本把用量、签到和探测结果分别存在 `stats.json`、`checkin.json` 和 `probe.json` 中。升级后第一次启动时，这三个文件会被导入 `hoshimi.db`，然后改名为 `*.migrated`。无法读取的文件改名为 `*.corrupt`，对应的记录从空开始。数据库里已经有这类记录时不会再次导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2668":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-75","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#确认","content":"检查配置能否读取，并列出将要启用的渠道和账号数量。确认无误后可以删除 `*.migrated` 文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2669":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-76","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"要做的事","locale":"zh-CN"},"2670":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-77","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2671":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-78","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置",