"url":"/docs/development-architecture#services","content":"在后台向 PyPI 查询是否有新版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"3147":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-76","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#services","content":"`conversations`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3148":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-77","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#services","content":"Playground 的对话","locale":"zh-CN"},"3149":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-78","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#services","content":"`agent`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3150":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-79","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#services","content":"Playground 工具的后台命令与审批","locale":"zh-CN"},"3151":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-80","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#services","content":"`build_services(settings=None)` 在没有传入设置时读取数据目录里的 `config.json`，然后：从配置收集每个渠道的账号和选项（`pool_inputs`），用它们构建 `Registry`；在数据目录打开 `hoshimi.db`，各个存储共用这个连接；最后创建续期、签到、登录和更新检查的服务。登录管理器在一次浏览器登录写入新账号后，立即用新配置重建渠道池。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3152":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-81","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#services","content":"直接构造的 `Services`（测试、嵌入）只需要 `settings` 和 `registry`，其余存储默认把数据放在内存里，定时器类服务为 `None`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3153":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-82","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"在 Web UI 保存设置会调用 `Services.apply_settings(new)`，不需要重启：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3154":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-83","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"只有**构建渠道池的输入**（每个渠道的账号、选项和禁用状态）变化时才重建池；只改端口之类的设置不会重建。重建时，配置没有变化的渠道原样保留，所以它们在内存里的状态（哪个账号的刷新令牌被拒绝、哪个账号正在冷却）不会丢；只有网络选项变化的渠道也保留，只更新路由。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3155":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-84","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"持有设置对象的每个服务（续期、签到、登录、更新检查、网络客户端）都改为指向新设置，免得某个服务稍后把旧配置写回文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3156":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-85","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"`server.check_updates` 的开关立即启停更新检查的定时器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3157":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-86","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"`Services.close()` 依次停止各个定时器、关闭 Playground 的后台命令和渠道的 HTTP 客户端，写入最后一批用量记录，然后关闭数据库。重复调用是安全的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3158":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-87","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"`hoshimi/api/app.py` 的 `create_app(services, ...)` 构建 FastAPI 应用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3159":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-88","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"3160":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-89","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3161":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-90","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"`services`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3162":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-91","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"应用的全部服务，放在 `app.state.services`；路由通过依赖 `ServicesDep` 取得","locale":"zh-CN"},"3163":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-92","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"`bound_host`、`bound_port`、`requested_port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3164":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-93","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"实际绑定的地址与请求的端口，设置页据此显示“端口被占用而换了一个”或“需要重启”","locale":"zh-CN"},"3165":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-94","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"`extra_hosts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3166":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-95","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"额外允许的 `Host` 头","locale":"zh-CN"},"3167":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-96","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"`serve_ui`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3168":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-97","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"是否提供 Web UI（`hoshimi serve --no-ui` 和测试传 `False`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3169":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-98","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"`api_prefix`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3170":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-99","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"把 API 和 Web UI 整体移到一个路径前缀下，便于挂进其他应用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3171":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-100","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"它做的事：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3172":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-101","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"校验安全设置，有问题时抛出 `ValidationError`，服务器不启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3173":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-102","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"生命周期：启动时按 `server.auto_refresh`、`server.auto_checkin`、`server.check_updates` 启动对应的定时器，并清理上次进程留下的临时对话；关闭时调用 `services.close()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3174":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-103","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"路由：`/health`；管理路由加上 `/api` 前缀（它们自己带 `/v1`，所以是 `/api/v1/...`）；模型路由在 `/v1`（Chat Completions、Responses、模型列表、TypeSafe 分类、Anthropic Messages）。交互式文档在 `/docs`，OpenAPI 文档在 `/openapi.json`，ReDoc 关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3175":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-104","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"中间件：配置了 `security.allow_origins` 时加 CORS；4096 字节以上的响应 gzip 压缩；`SecurityMiddleware` 检查 `Host` 头、浏览器请求的来源、客户端地址是否在允许的 CIDR 内，以及访问密钥（管理 API 与文档）和模型 API 密钥（`/v1/`）。规则见安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3176":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-105","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"最后挂载 Web UI（`SPAStaticFiles`）：只接收其他路由都不匹配的路径；`assets/` 下带哈希的文件缓存一年，`index.html` 不缓存；接受 HTML 的未知路径回落到 `index.html`，其他未知路径仍是 404。没有构建产物时记录警告，只提供 API。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3177":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-106","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"把 Hoshimi 嵌入另一个 ASGI 应用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3178":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-107","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"Web UI 从自身脚