elease#发布一个版本","content":"发布一个版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"3495":{"id":"/docs/development-release-10","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#改版本号","content":"改版本号","locale":"zh-CN"},"3496":{"id":"/docs/development-release-11","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#推送到-main","content":"推送到 `main`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3497":{"id":"/docs/development-release-12","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#推送标签可选","content":"推送标签（可选）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3498":{"id":"/docs/development-release-13","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#手动运行-release","content":"手动运行 Release","locale":"zh-CN"},"3499":{"id":"/docs/development-release-14","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#凭据","content":"凭据","locale":"zh-CN"},"3500":{"id":"/docs/development-release-15","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#文档站的部署","content":"文档站的部署","locale":"zh-CN"},"3501":{"id":"/docs/development-release-16","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release","content":"Hoshimi 发布一个发行包：`hoshimi` 的 wheel 和 sdist，二者都包含构建好的 Web UI。CI 对每次推送和拉取请求做同样的检查和构建；推送到发布分支时改动了 `hoshimi/version.py`，CI 就把**同一次运行中检查过、构建过**的文件发布到 PyPI。文档站与发行包分开部署。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3502":{"id":"/docs/development-release-17","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本号","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3503":{"id":"/docs/development-release-18","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本号","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"3504":{"id":"/docs/development-release-19","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本号","content":"`hoshimi/version.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3505":{"id":"/docs/development-release-20","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本号","content":"`VERSION = \"x.y.z\"`，唯一的来源：`pyproject.toml` 通过 `dynamic = [\"version\"]` 读取它，`hoshimi version` 显示它","locale":"zh-CN"},"3506":{"id":"/docs/development-release-21","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本号","content":"`hoshimi/webui/package.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3507":{"id":"/docs/development-release-22","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本号","content":"`version` 手动跟随，发布提交里一起修改；没有检查强制二者一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"3508":{"id":"/docs/development-release-23","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本号","content":"推送 `v<版本>` 标签时，构建作业要求标签与 `hoshimi/version.py` 一致（`0.5.0` 对应 `v0.5.0`），否则失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3509":{"id":"/docs/development-release-24","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#构建发行包scriptsbuild_wheelpy","content":"setuptools 只打包运行时已经存在的文件，所以必须先构建 Web UI；直接运行 `python -m build` 可能得到一个没有界面的包。`build_wheel.py` 按顺序完成：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3510":{"id":"/docs/development-release-25","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#构建发行包scriptsbuild_wheelpy","content":"在 `hoshimi/webui` 中 `bun install --frozen-lockfile`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3511":{"id":"/docs/development-release-26","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#构建发行包scriptsbuild_wheelpy","content":"`bun run build`（含 vue-tsc 类型检查），或 `--ci` 时 `bun run build:only`（CI 已单独做过类型检查和测试）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3512":{"id":"/docs/development-release-27","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#构建发行包scriptsbuild_wheelpy","content":"