e","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#releaseyml","content":"发布成功且引用是标签","locale":"zh-CN"},"3588":{"id":"/docs/development-release-103","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#releaseyml","content":"以标签为名创建 GitHub 发布并附上这些文件，说明自动生成；发布已存在时用 `--clobber` 重新上传文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3589":{"id":"/docs/development-release-104","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#releaseyml","content":"发布按 `hoshimi-pypi-release` 组排队，从不取消，所以一次版本推送和随后的标签推送不会同时上传。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3590":{"id":"/docs/development-release-105","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#改版本号","content":"修改 `hoshimi/version.py` 的 `VERSION`，并让 `hoshimi/webui/package.json` 的 `version` 跟上。按惯例，提交信息为 `chore: release x.y.z`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3591":{"id":"/docs/development-release-106","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#推送到-main","content":"CI 检查、构建、在安装后检查，然后把这些文件上传到 PyPI。在 Actions 中可以看到 Release 作业；`pypi` 环境若配置了审批，要在这里批准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3592":{"id":"/docs/development-release-107","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#推送标签可选","content":"标签会再运行一次 CI：检查标签与版本号一致，上传时跳过 PyPI 上已有的文件，然后创建带有发行包和自动生成说明的 GitHub 发布。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3593":{"id":"/docs/development-release-108","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#手动运行-release","content":"在 Actions 中手动运行 **Release** 工作流时，它先运行同样的检查和构建。输入 `publish` 默认关闭，此时只产出检查过的文件，可以下载 `distributions` 产物查看；打开它并在 `main`、`hoshimi_main` 或标签上运行，才会发布。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3594":{"id":"/docs/development-release-109","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#凭据","content":"上传使用 PyPI API 令牌：在 `pypi` 环境或仓库的机密中设置 `TWINE_PASSWORD`（用户名固定为 `__token__`）。没有设置时，发布作业给出错误并失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3595":{"id":"/docs/development-release-110","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#文档站的部署","content":"本站（`site/`）与发行包分开部署：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3596":{"id":"/docs/development-release-111","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#文档站的部署","content":"**Netlify**（主站，hoshimi-dev.netlify.app）：每次推送到 `main` 都构建 `site/`，配置在仓库根目录的 `netlify.toml`；`site/` 没有改动时跳过构建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3597":{"id":"/docs/development-release-112","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#文档站的部署","content":"**GitHub Pages**（备份，licyk.github.io/Hoshimi）：`.github/workflows/site.yml` 以 `VITE_BASE_PATH=/Hoshimi/` 构建站点，并强制推送到 `gh-pages` 分支，由 Pages 提供服务。备份站的页面带有指向 Netlify 站点的 canonical 链接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3598":{"id":"/docs/development-release-113","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#文档站的部署","content":"CI 的共享检查也会对文档站做类型检查、测试和构建，所以一个让站点构建失败的改动过不了 CI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3599":{"id":"/docs/development-release-114","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#文档站的部署","content":"站点的结构、写法和本地构建见文档站。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3600":{"id":"/docs/development-setup","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"page","content":"开发环境","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup","locale":"zh-CN"},"3601":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-0","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup","content":"从一份新克隆到能同时运行 API 与 Web UI 的开发模式：仓库布局、Python 环境、bun，以及 scripts/dev.py 的全部任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3602":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-1","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"仓库布局","locale":"zh-CN"},"3603":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-2","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#python-环境","content":"Python 环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"3604":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-3","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#克隆并建立虚拟环境","content":"克隆并建立虚拟环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"3605":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-4","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#以可编辑方式安装带上开发依赖","content":"以可编辑方式安装，带上开发依赖","locale":"zh-CN"},"3606":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-5","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#确认环境","content":"确认环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"3607":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-6","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#web-uibun","content":"Web UI：bun","locale":"zh-CN"},"3608":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-7","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"开发模式：API 与 Vite 一起运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"3609":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-8","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#用单独的数据目录","content":"用单独的数据目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"3610":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-9","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#只运行界面","content":"只运行界面","locale":"zh-CN"},"3611":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-10","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`scripts/dev.py` 的任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"3612":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-11","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#参考项目的克隆","content":"参考项目的克隆","locale":"zh-CN"},"3613":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-12","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup","content":"Hoshimi 的开发环境由两部分组成：一个以可编辑方式安装了 Hoshimi 及其开发依赖的 Python 环境，以及用来安装、构建和测试 Web UI 与本文档站的 bun。日常任务都通过 `scripts/dev.py` 运行：它只用标准库，在 Linux、macOS 和 Windows 上行为一致，运行的也正是 CI 运行的那些工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3614":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-13","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"`scripts/` 里的脚本：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3615":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-14","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"脚本","locale":"zh-CN"},"3616":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-15","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3617":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-16","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"`dev.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3618":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-17","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"任务入口，见下文","locale":"zh-CN"},"3619":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-18","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"`build_wheel.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3620":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-19","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"先构建 Web UI，再构建 wheel 和 sdist，见 CI 与发布","locale":"zh-CN"},"3621":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-20","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"`smoke_install.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3622":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-21","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"用已安装发行包的解释器检查它能否正常工作","locale":"zh-CN"},"3623":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-22","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"`ci.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3624":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-23","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"CI 的发布计划：这次推送是否发布","locale":"zh-CN"},"3625":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-24","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"`generate_openapi.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3626":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-25","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"在标准输出打印 OpenAPI 文档，供 Web UI 生成类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"3627":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-26","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"`generate_provider_inventory.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3628":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-27","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"生成渠道来源清单页面","locale":"zh-CN"},"3629":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-28","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"`check_layout.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3630":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-29","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#仓库布局","content":"在真实浏览器里检查 Web UI 有没有横向溢出，见测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"3631":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-30","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#克隆并建立虚拟环境","content":"Hoshimi 支持 Python 3.10 及以上；CI 的 lint 与构建使用 3.11。`.venv/` 已在 `.gitignore` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3632":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-31","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#以可编辑方式安装带上开发依赖","content":"`dev` 附加依赖包含 pytest、Ruff、ty、build 和官方 Anthropic SDK（Messages 的回归测试用到它）。要覆盖云渠道的代码，再加上 `google`（`google-auth[requests]`）和 `bedrock`（`boto3`）：CI 的类型检查和测试安装的就是 `.[dev,google,bedrock]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3633":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-32","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#确认环境","content":"`dev.py` 用运行它的解释器（`sys.executable`）调用 Ruff、ty 和 pytest，而不是 `PATH` 上的那个，所以用虚拟环境里的 `python` 运行它即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3634":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-33","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#web-uibun","content":"Web UI（`hoshimi/webui/`）和文档站（`site/`）都用 bun 安装、构建和测试；CI 使用 bun 1.4.2。`dev.py` 在 `PATH` 上找不到 `bun` 时给出一行说明并以状态 127 退出，而不是抛出回溯。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3635":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-34","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#web-uibun","content":"构建好的 `dist/` 作为包数据随 wheel 发布。在源码目录里运行 `hoshimi serve` 时，若没有 `dist/index.html`，服务器记录一条警告，只提供 API。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3636":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-35","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"它同时启动两个进程，并给每一行输出加上进程名（`api` 或 `web`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3637":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-36","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"**API**：`python -m hoshimi serve --no-open --no-ui --port 10600 --strict-port`，仓库根目录放在 `PYTHONPATH` 最前面，所以运行的是工作区里的代码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3638":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-37","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"**Vite**：在 `hoshimi/webui` 中运行 `bun run dev --port 5173 --strictPort`，并设置 `HOSHIMI_BACKEND=http://127.0.0.1:10600`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3639":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-38","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"浏览器只需打开 `http://localhost:5173`：Vite 把 `/api`、`/v1`、`/health`、`/openapi.json`、`/docs` 和 `/redoc` 代理给 API，所以界面和模型 API 都在这一个地址上。界面的改动就地热更新；Python 的改动需要重新运行这个任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3640":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-39","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"3641":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-40","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"3642":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-41","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3643":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-42","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"`--api-port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3644":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-43","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"`10600`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3645":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-44","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"API 服务器的端口","locale":"zh-CN"},"3646":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-45","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"`--web-port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3647":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-46","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"`5173`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3648":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-47","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"Vite 的端口","locale":"zh-CN"},"3649":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-48","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"Ctrl+C 同时停止两个进程；其中一个退出时，另一个也被停止，任务以它的退出状态结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3650":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-49","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"还没有安装 Web UI 依赖时，任务提示先运行 `python scripts/dev.py web-install`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3651":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-50","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#开发模式api-与-vite-一起运行","content":"API 重启期间，Vite 的代理最多每 5 秒打印一行“API 没有响应”，并以 HTTP 502 和 `{\"code\": \"api_unreachable\", ...}` 回答请求，而不是刷出一屏连接错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3652":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-51","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#用单独的数据目录","content":"开发时的配置、账号和用量记录与平时的数据分开，只需设置 `HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3653":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-52","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#用单独的数据目录","content":"数据目录的其他内容见路径与数据目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3654":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-53","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#只运行界面","content":"API 已经在别处运行时，`python scripts/dev.py web-dev` 只启动 Vite。它默认代理到 `http://127.0.0.1:10600`；API 在其他地址时，先把环境变量 `HOSHIMI_BACKEND` 设为那个地址（例如 `http://127.0.0.1:10601`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3655":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-54","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"不带参数运行 `python scripts/dev.py` 列出全部任务。可以一次写多个任务，按顺序运行，遇到第一个失败就停止。任务名之后从第一个以 `-` 开头的参数起，都交给该任务；带选项时只能运行一个任务，不接受选项的任务收到选项时以状态 2 失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3656":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-55","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"3657":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-56","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3658":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-57","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`lint`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3659":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-58","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`ruff check hoshimi tests scripts`，不改动任何文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3660":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-59","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`format`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3661":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-60","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`ruff check --fix` 和 `ruff format`，作用于同样的目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"3662":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-61","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`typecheck-py [ty 选项…]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3663":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-62","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`ty check`，额外的选项原样传给 ty（CI 用它传入 Python 版本和平台）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3664":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-63","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`test-py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3665":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-64","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"运行 pytest（`tests/` 下的全部测试）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3666":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-65","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`web-install`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3667":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-66","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"在 `hoshimi/webui` 中 `bun install`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3668":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-67","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs