nt-site#结构","content":"站点位于仓库的 `site/`，用 TanStack Start、Fumadocs（MDX）和 Tailwind 构建，用 bun 安装和运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3718":{"id":"/docs/development-site-18","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"3719":{"id":"/docs/development-site-19","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"3720":{"id":"/docs/development-site-20","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"`site/content/docs/<slug>.mdx`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3721":{"id":"/docs/development-site-21","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"简体中文页面（默认语言）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3722":{"id":"/docs/development-site-22","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"`site/content/docs/<slug>.en.mdx`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3723":{"id":"/docs/development-site-23","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"同一页面的英文版","locale":"zh-CN"},"3724":{"id":"/docs/development-site-24","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"`site/content/docs/meta.json`、`meta.en.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3725":{"id":"/docs/development-site-25","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"中文和英文的侧边栏：页面顺序与分组","locale":"zh-CN"},"3726":{"id":"/docs/development-site-26","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"`site/src/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3727":{"id":"/docs/development-site-27","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"路由、布局、首页和组件；可用的 MDX 组件在 `src/components/mdx.tsx` 中注册","locale":"zh-CN"},"3728":{"id":"/docs/development-site-28","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"`site/scripts/prepare-static-output.mjs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3729":{"id":"/docs/development-site-29","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"构建后检查输出是否完整","locale":"zh-CN"},"3730":{"id":"/docs/development-site-30","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"`site/public/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3731":{"id":"/docs/development-site-31","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"原样复制到输出的静态文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3732":{"id":"/docs/development-site-32","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"两种语言共用同一个地址 `/docs/<slug>`：站点按读者选过的语言（保存在浏览器中）显示对应版本，没有选过时，浏览器首选语言是中文就显示中文，否则显示英文。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3733":{"id":"/docs/development-site-33","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#本地预览与构建","content":"开发服务器固定在 `http://127.0.0.1:3000`，端口被占用时直接失败，而不是换一个端口。构建产出 `site/.output/public`；构建脚本随后运行 `prepare-static-output.mjs`，确认 `meta.json` 中列出的每个页面都生成了 HTML，并把 `_shell.html` 复制为 `404.html`。所以侧边栏里有、但没有对应文件的页面会让构建失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3734":{"id":"/docs/development-site-34","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#建两个文件","content":"在 `site/content/docs/` 中新建 `<slug>.mdx`（中文）和 `<slug>.en.mdx`（英文）。slug 用小写和连字符，按所属部分加前缀（`guide-`、`clients-`、`providers-`、`cli-`、`config-`、`advanced-`、`api-`、`development-`）。两个文件的结构要相同：同样的章节、同样的顺序、同样的代码块和链接。中文写自然的简体中文，不是逐字翻译；英文写平实直接的英文。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3735":{"id":"/docs/development-site-35","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3736":{"id":"/docs/development-site-36","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"3737":{"id":"/docs/development-site-37","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"`title`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3738":{"id":"/docs/development-site-38","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"页面标题；正文里不要再写一个 `#` 标题","locale":"zh-CN"},"3739":{"id":"/docs/development-site-39","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"`description`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3740":{"id":"/docs/development-site-40","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"显示在标题下方，也用于搜索和页面元数据","locale":"zh-CN"},"3741":{"id":"/docs/development-site-41","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"`icon`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3742":{"id":"/docs/development-site-42","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"Lucide 图标名，PascalCase（如 `Rocket`、`Terminal`、`Settings`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3743":{"id":"/docs/development-site-43","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"正文以一段简短的引言开始，然后是 `##` 章节。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3744":{"id":"/docs/development-site-44","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#加进侧边栏","content":"把 slug 加进 `meta.json` 和 `meta.en.json` 的 `pages`，两者的位置相同。`\"---标题---\"` 形式的条目是分组标题，可以不同语言各写各的；页面 slug 的列表和顺序必须完全一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3745":{"id":"/docs/development-site-45","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#检查","content":"运行 `bun run test` 和 `bun run build`（或 `python scripts/dev.py test-site` 与 `site`），在 `bun run dev` 中