e-66","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#链接","content":"站内链接写成 `/docs/<slug>`，不带语言前缀和 `.mdx`，两种语言的页面写法相同；需要时加 `#锚点`。锚点由标题文字生成，最好只链接到自己写的标题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3767":{"id":"/docs/development-site-67","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#链接","content":"源码链接写成 `https://github.com/licyk/Hoshimi/blob/main/<路径>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3768":{"id":"/docs/development-site-68","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"每一句话都要能在代码中找到依据；旧文档或记忆与代码不一致时，以代码为准。无法确认的内容不写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3769":{"id":"/docs/development-site-69","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"页面内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"3770":{"id":"/docs/development-site-70","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"依据","locale":"zh-CN"},"3771":{"id":"/docs/development-site-71","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"配置键与默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"3772":{"id":"/docs/development-site-72","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"`hoshimi/core/config.py`、`hoshimi/core/paths.py`、`config.example.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3773":{"id":"/docs/development-site-73","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"命令与选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"3774":{"id":"/docs/development-site-74","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"`hoshimi/cli/`；`hoshimi <命令> --help`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3775":{"id":"/docs/development-site-75","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"环境变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"3776":{"id":"/docs/development-site-76","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"`hoshimi env`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3777":{"id":"/docs/development-site-77","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"端点","locale":"zh-CN"},"3778":{"id":"/docs/development-site-78","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"`hoshimi/api/routers/`；运行中服务器的 `/docs` 与 `/openapi.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3779":{"id":"/docs/development-site-79","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"渠道的注册与账号字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3780":{"id":"/docs/development-site-80","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"`hoshimi/core/providers/factory.py`、`hoshimi/core/provider_forms.py`、`hoshimi/core/provider_definitions.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3781":{"id":"/docs/development-site-81","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"Web UI 的文字","locale":"zh-CN"},"3782":{"id":"/docs/development-site-82","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"英文页面用 `hoshimi/webui/src/i18n/en.ts` 中的标签，中文页面用 `zh-CN.ts` 中的标签，加粗书写","locale":"zh-CN"},"3783":{"id":"/docs/development-site-83","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"查看命令行的帮助时，用一个临时数据目录，以免动到真实的数据：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3784":{"id":"/docs/development-site-84","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#内容以代码为准","content":"写作上，以任务为导向：先说做什么、为什么，再讲细节。参考类页面要完整（每个命令、键、端点），指南类页面要走完真实的任务。示例尽量是可以直接复制的命令、JSON 或 curl。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3785":{"id":"/docs/development-site-85","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#生成的页面","content":"渠道来源清单（`providers-inventory.mdx` 与 `providers-inventory.en.mdx`）由脚本根据 `hoshimi/core/provider_sources.py` 生成，不要手工修改：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3786":{"id":"/docs/development-site-86","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#生成的页面","content":"两种语言使用同一张表，只有表格周围的文字不同。改了 `provider_sources.py` 就重新运行它，并提交生成的两个文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3787":{"id":"/docs/development-site-87","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#部署","content":"站点","locale":"zh-CN"},"3788":{"id":"/docs/development-site-88","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#部署","content":"地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"3789":{"id":"/docs/development-site-89","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#部署","content":"方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"3790":{"id":"/docs/development-site-90","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#部署","content":"主站","locale":"zh-CN"},"3791":{"id":"/docs/development-site-91","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#部署","content":"hoshimi-dev.netlify.app","locale":"zh-CN"},"3792":{"id":"/docs/development-site-92","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#部署","content":"Netlify 在每次推送到 `main` 时构建 `site/`，配置在仓库根目录的 `netlify.toml`；`site/` 没有改动时跳过","locale":"zh-CN"},"3793":{"id":"/docs/development-site-93","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#部署","content":"备份","locale":"zh-CN"},"3794":{"id":"/docs/development-site-94","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#部署","content":"licyk.github.io/Hoshimi","locale":"zh-CN"},"3795":{"id":"/docs/development-site-95","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#部署","content":"`.github/workflows/site.yml` 以 `VITE_BASE_PATH=/Hoshimi/` 构建，并（用 `GITEE_RSA_PRIVATE_KEY` 部署密钥）强制推送到 `gh-pages` 分支，由 Pages 提供服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"3796":{"id":"/docs/development-site-96","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#部署","content":"站点支持部署在子路径下：`VITE_BASE_PATH` 设置 Vite 的 `base`，路由和搜索索引都跟随它。备份站的页面带有指向 Netlify 站点的 canonical 链接，让搜索引擎以主站为准。CI 的共享检查也会对站点做类型检查、测试和构建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3797":{"id":"/docs/development-site-97","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#统计与评论","content":"**统计**：站点使用 Umami，只在生产构建中加载，并且只在两个站点域名上计数；本地预览不计数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3798":{"id":"/docs/development-site-98","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#统计与评论","content":"**评论**：每个文档页面的末尾有 Giscus 评论区（`components/docs-comments.tsx`、`lib/giscus.ts`，与 rvc-next 的站点相同），基于本仓库的 GitHub Discussions，分类为 “Comment”。每个页面对应一个讨论帖，以 `specific` 方式按页面路径对应，路径去掉站点基础路径、语言前缀和首尾斜杠（`docs/<slug>`），所以同一页面的中英文版本、主站（位于根路径）和备份站（位于 `/Hoshimi/` 下）共用同一个帖子。评论区跟随站点的明暗主题和语言，切换时直接通知已加载的评论框，而不重新加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3799":{"id":"/docs/development-site-99","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#readme","content":"仓库的 `README.md` 和 `README.zh-CN.md` 也是 PyPI 上的项目说明，所以其中的链接都写成完整的 URL（指向本站或 GitHub），而不是仓库内的相对路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3800":{"id":"/docs/development-testing","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"page","content":"测试","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing","locale":"zh-CN"},"3801":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-0","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"Hoshimi 的各类检查：pytest 的布局与共享夹具、写渠道和路由测试的方式、Web UI 的 Vitest 规则测试、生成类型的检查、在真实浏览器里查横向溢出的 check_layout.py，以及 CI 怎样运行它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3802":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-1","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#一览","content":"一览","locale":"zh-CN"},"3803":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-2","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#python-测试","content":"Python 测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"3804":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-3","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"布局","locale":"zh-CN"},"3805":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-4","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#共享夹具","content":"共享夹具","locale":"zh-CN"},"3806":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-5","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#常用写法","content":"常用写法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3807":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-6","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"Web UI 测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"3808":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-7","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#生成类型的检查","content":"生成类型的检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"3809":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-8","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#在浏览器里检查布局check_layoutpy","content":"在浏览器里检查布局：`check_layout.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3810":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-9","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#ci-中的检查","content":"CI 中的检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"3811":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-10","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"Hoshimi 的测试不访问网络，也不需要任何真实的渠道凭据：上游由假的渠道或 `httpx.MockTransport` 代替，每个测试都有自己的临时数据目录。提交前运行一次 `python scripts/dev.py check`，它覆盖 CI 的 Python 与 Web UI 检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3812":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-11","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","u