guide-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-agent#输入框中的盾牌菜单","content":"输入框中的盾牌菜单","locale":"zh-CN"},"4234":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"自动审查","locale":"zh-CN"},"4235":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"批准调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4236":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"工具卡片","locale":"zh-CN"},"4237":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-agent#在回复进行中补充说明","content":"在回复进行中补充说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"4238":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-agent#输入框上方的后台命令","content":"输入框上方的后台命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"4239":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-agent#工作区","content":"工作区","locale":"zh-CN"},"4240":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-agent#停止","content":"停止","locale":"zh-CN"},"4241":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-agent#安全","content":"安全","locale":"zh-CN"},"4242":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"设置参考","locale":"zh-CN"},"4243":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent","content":"开启工具后，Playground 的回复就成了一个智能体循环：模型可以使用内置工具；每一轮它先流式输出文字，它调用的工具依次运行（需要批准的先由审查模型或你批准），结果返回给模型，如此往复，直到某一轮不再调用工具为止。回复中的每次调用都显示为一张可以展开的卡片。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4244":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent","content":"命令和文件编辑在运行 Hoshimi 的机器上执行，权限就是运行它的用户的权限，没有沙箱。所有工具默认开启，新对话从 **自动审查** 开始：每条命令、每次文件更改以及工作区外的访问在执行前都先由模型判断，有风险的会被拒绝。**先询问** 则全部交给你决定。下文的“安全”一节说明了每种模式会放行什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4245":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择工具","content":"打开 **设置 › 工具**，**工具** 中六个工具默认全部开启，关掉不需要的即可（见设置）。这就是所有对话使用的工具：对话没有自己的开关，更改从下一次回复起对所有对话生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4246":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择工具","content":"如果你的配置文件从未设置过 `playground.tools` 或 `playground.approval`，现在会得到全部工具和 **自动审查**。配置中写明 `\"tools\": []` 的则一个工具都不开启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4247":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择支持工具调用的模型","content":"只有支持工具调用的模型才会收到工具。目录中标记为不支持工具调用的模型会在没有工具的情况下作答，回复中注明“*模型* 不支持调用工具，因此在没有工具的情况下作答。”如果站点在回复开始前拒绝了工具，回复也会去掉工具再试一次，并给出同样的提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4248":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"开关（设置中）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4249":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"模型看到的工具名","locale":"zh-CN"},"4250":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4251":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"何时先询问（完全访问下从不询问）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4252":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"**读取文件**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4253":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"`read`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4254":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","co