e":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"为不能读取图片的模型描述图片：`auto`、`off` 或某个模型 ID","locale":"zh-CN"},"4891":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-175","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"**自动压缩长对话**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4892":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-176","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"`playground.auto_compact`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4893":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-177","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"`true`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4894":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-178","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"对话接近窗口上限时自动压缩。被拒绝为过长的请求无论如何都会压缩","locale":"zh-CN"},"4895":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-179","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"**压缩阈值**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4896":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-180","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"`playground.compact_threshold`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4897":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-181","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"`0.85`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4898":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-182","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"对话达到窗口的多大比例（0.5 到 0.95）时压缩","locale":"zh-CN"},"4899":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-183","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"**总结模型**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4900":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-184","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"`playground.compact_model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4901":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-185","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"空（**对话自身使用的模型**）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4902":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-186","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"撰写总结的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4903":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-187","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"工具相关的设置（`playground.tools`、`workspace`、`approval`、`search_url`）见 Playground 工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4904":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-188","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#适合-playground-的系统提示词","content":"系统提示词默认为空，模型只能看到对话和工具说明。下面这套提示词补上其余部分：何时直接动手、何时询问，如何用好工具，如何对待批准、对话中途补充的消息和压缩，以及回复在这里如何渲染。把它粘贴到 **设置 › 通用 › Playground › 系统提示词** 即可。它适用于开启和不开启工具的对话，也适用于任何模型；回复会使用用户提问所用的语言。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4905":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-189","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#适合-playground-的系统提示词","content":"它改编自 OpenAI 的 Codex 发给模型的基础指令。只有 Codex 才有的部分已去掉（它的身份、消息通道、技能、应用、插件和 JavaScript 工具调度），Playground 不同的地方已相应调整：本地文件写路径而不是链接；问题直接写在回复里；工具说明已经介绍了每个工具，所以提示词只讲怎么用好它们，不重复它们是什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4906":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-190","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#适合-playground-的系统提示词","content":"推荐使用英文版：模型对英文指令的遵循最稳定，而回复仍会使用用户的语言。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4907":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-191","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#适合-playground-的系统提示词","content":"也可以使用中文版，内容与英文版相同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4908":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-192","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#适合-playground-的系统提示词","content":"可以按需修改：说明你的项目及其约定、或设定语气的内容，加在最后即可。提示词只是描述；工具实际能做什么，仍由你开启的工具和批准模式决定（见 Playground 工具）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4909":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-193","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话保存在哪里","content":"对话、消息和附件保存在数据目录的 `hoshimi.db` 中（见数据目录与路径），直到你删除为止。上次打开的对话也记录在这里，因此在任何浏览器中打开 Playground 都能回到它。服务停止时被中断的回复会保存为已停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4910":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-194","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话保存在哪里","content":"Playground 发起的每次模型调用都会像其他调用一样记录在用量中，并带有各自的来源：回复为 `playground`，命名标题为 `playground-title`，描述图片为 `playground-vision`，压缩总结为 `playground-compact`，自动审查工具调用为 `playground-review`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4911":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-195","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话保存在哪里","content":"<Card title=\"Playground 工具\" href=\"/docs/guide-agent\" description=\"让模型读取和编辑文件、运行命令、搜索网页，并由你批准。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"4912":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-196","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话保存在哪里","content":"<Card title=\"Playground API\" href=\"/docs/api-playground\" description=\"这个页面背后的对话接口与流式事件。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"4913":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"page","content":"设置","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings","locale":"zh-CN"},"4914":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings","content":"设置页的八个标签页：常规、工具、访问、安全、网络、自动化、外观与关于，每一项的作用和对应的配置项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4915":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"常规","locale":"zh-CN"},"4916":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#工具","content":"工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"4917":{"id":"/d