10","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage","content":"**用量** 页记录经过网关的每一次调用：用了多少 Token、缓存命中多少、首字延迟和生成速度、由哪个渠道的哪个账号回答、是否失败。数据保存在数据目录的 `hoshimi.db` 中，重启后仍在。用量是如何记录和统计的，见用量统计。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5147":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage","content":"还没有任何调用时，页面显示 **还没有任何回答**：通过网关发一次请求（或在 Playground 中聊一句），数据就会出现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5148":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#时间范围","content":"工具栏左侧选择范围：**单日**、**24 小时**、**7 天**（默认）、**30 天**、**90 天**。范围记在地址中（如 `#/usage?range=30d`），刷新或分享链接时打开同一个范围。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5149":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#时间范围","content":"选 **单日** 时出现日期导航：左右箭头切换 **前一天** 和 **后一天**，中间的按钮（显示 **今天**、**昨天** 或日期）打开日历。日历中有用量的日子按当天 Token 量深浅着色；不能选择今天之后，或第一天有记录之前的日期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5150":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#时间范围","content":"范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"5151":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#时间范围","content":"图表的单位","locale":"zh-CN"},"5152":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#时间范围","content":"与什么比较","locale":"zh-CN"},"5153":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#时间范围","content":"**单日**（今天）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5154":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#时间范围","content":"小时","locale":"zh-CN"},"5155":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#时间范围","content":"**与昨天同一时刻相比**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5156":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"typ