**、**推理强度**、**响应方式**（**流式** 或 **整体**）、**尝试账户数**（轮换过几个账户）、**结束原因**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5250":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#调用记录","content":"Token：**按缓存使用划分的输入** 条，以及 **输入 token**、**未缓存输入**、**缓存读取**（及占比）、**缓存写入**、**输出 token**、**思考 token**。上游没有报告用量时注明 **未上报用量**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5251":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#调用记录","content":"**耗时**：**首字延迟**、**解码**、**用时**、**tok/s**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5252":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#调用记录","content":"详情面板右上角的箭头（或键盘的 ↑、↓）切换到 **较新的调用** 和 **较早的调用**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5253":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#什么算一次调用什么算失败","content":"Chat Completions、Responses、Messages、分类和 Playground 的每个请求各记一条，换了几个账户也只算一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5254":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#什么算一次调用什么算失败","content":"出错的请求算失败，包括还没发到上游就失败的路由错误（例如找不到模型）。客户端中途断开连接时算作已回答，不算网关失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5255":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#什么算一次调用什么算失败","content":"缓存写入取自 `prompt_tokens_details.cache_write_tokens`（或 `cache_creation_tokens`、Anthropic 的 `cache_creation_input_tokens`）；DeepSeek 的 `prompt_cache_hit_tokens` 计为缓存读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5256":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-120","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#保留期限","content":"数据","locale":"zh-CN"},"5257":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-121","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#保留期限","content":"保留多久","locale":"zh-CN"},"5258":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-122","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#保留期限","content":"每次调用的记录","locale":"zh-CN"},"5259":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-123","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#保留期限","content":"`server.stats_keep_days` 天（默认 90），在 **设置 › 常规 › 用量历史** 中修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"5260":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-124","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#保留期限","content":"逐小时总计","locale":"zh-CN"},"5261":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-125","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#保留期限","content":"120 天","locale":"zh-CN"},"5262":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#保留期限","content":"每日总计和累计数","locale":"zh-CN"},"5263":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#保留期限","content":"永久","locale":"zh-CN"},"5264":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#保留期限","content":"修改保留天数后，从下一次清理起生效；清理随新的调用进行，最多每分钟一次。统计大约每秒写入一次数据库，服务器关闭时也会写入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5265":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#重置统计","content":"⋮ 菜单中的 **重置统计** 清除所有计数、图表和调用记录。确认 **重置所有用量统计？** 后执行，**无法撤销**。重置时正在进行的调用结束后仍会被记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5266":{"id":"/docs/guide-usage-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-usage#重置统计","content":"重置会删除 `hoshimi.db` 中的全部用量数据。只想少保留一些记录时，调小 **调用记录保留天数** 即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5267":{"id":"/docs/guide","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"page","content":"界面总览","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide","locale":"zh-CN"},"5268":{"id":"/docs/guide-0","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"Web 界面的整体布局：导航、顶栏的实时活动、访问密钥登录、语言与外观，以及各页面教程的入口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5269":{"id":"/docs/guide-1","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"导航","locale":"zh-CN"},"5270":{"id":"/docs/guide-2","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"顶栏","locale":"zh-CN"},"5271":{"id":"/docs/guide-3","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide#访问密钥","content":"访问密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"5272":{"id":"/docs/guide-4","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide#语言与外观","content":"语言与外观","locale":"zh-CN"},"5273":{"id":"/docs/guide-5","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide#模型目录的加载","content":"模型目录的加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"5274":{"id":"/docs/guide-6","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"各页面的教程","locale":"zh-CN"},"5275":{"id":"/docs/guide-7","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"本节逐页讲解 Hoshimi 的 Web 界面。启动 `hoshimi serve` 后，在浏览器中打开 `http://127.0.0.1:10600`（端口被占用时以服务器打印的地址为准）。还没有安装的话，先看快速开始；第一次打开界面时会看到什么，见首次启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5276":{"id":"/docs/guide-8","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"在 **渠道** 和 **设置** 中做的修改都写入数据目录中的 `config.json`（外观和语言等浏览器偏好除外），并立即作用于正在运行的网关，不需要重启（监听地址和端口除外）。大部分操作也可以用命令行或管理 API 完成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5277":{"id":"/docs/guide-9","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"窗口较宽时导航栏在左侧，窄窗口（如手机）时移到底部。**设置** 固定在导航栏最下方。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5278":{"id":"/docs/guide-10","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"页面","locale":"zh-CN"},"5279":{"id":"/docs/guide-11","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"用来做什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"5280":{"id":"/docs/guide-12","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**概览**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5281":{"id":"/docs/guide-13","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"今天的用量、可复制的接口地址、已启用的渠道、版本与默认模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5282":{"id":"/docs/guide-14","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**模型**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5283":{"id":"/docs/guide-15","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"所有可调用的模型：搜索、能力、上下文长度、可用性探测，并可直接在 Playground 中试用","locale":"zh-CN"},"5284":{"id":"/docs/guide-16","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**渠道**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5285":{"id":"/docs/guide-17","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"每个提供商（免费站点、云服务、本地服务）的账号：登录、添加密钥、续期、签到、额度和网络线路","locale":"zh-CN"},"5286":{"id":"/docs/guide-18","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**用量**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5287":{"id":"/docs/guide-19","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"Token 用量、缓存命中、首字延迟和速度的图表，按模型/提供方/账户/接口的明细，以及每一次调用的记录","locale":"zh-CN"},"5288":{"id":"/docs/guide-20","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**Playground**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5289":{"id":"/docs/guide-21","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"在浏览器中直接和任意模型对话；开启工具后还能读写文件、运行命令、搜索网页","locale":"zh-CN"},"5290":{"id":"/docs/guide-22","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**设置**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5291":{"id":"/docs/guide-23","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"语言、默认模型、Playground 与工具、监听地址和密钥、访问限制、全局网络、定时任务、外观","locale":"zh-CN"},"5292":{"id":"/docs/guide-24","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"有渠道需要处理（需要重新登录、令牌过期、账户被暂停轮换、额度快用完）时，**渠道** 图标上会显示需要处理的渠道数量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5293":{"id":"/docs/guide-25","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"每个页面在切换后保持原来的状态和滚动位置，再次点导航会回到你离开时的位置。部分状态记在地址里，刷新或把链接发给别人时会打开同一个视图：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5294":{"id":"/docs/guide-26","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"5295":{"id":"/docs/guide-27","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"打开","locale":"zh-CN"},"5296":{"id":"/docs/guide-28","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"`#/channels/kilo`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5297":{"id":"/docs/guide-29","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**渠道** 页中的 Kilo 渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"5298":{"id":"/docs/guide-30","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"`#/usage?range=30d`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5299":{"id":"/docs/guide-31","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**用量** 页的 **30 天** 范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"5300":{"id":"/docs/guide-32","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"`#/usage?range=day&date=2026-10-20`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5301":{"id":"/docs/guide-33","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**用量** 页中的某一天","locale":"zh-CN"},"5302":{"id":"/docs/guide-34","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"`#/settings?tab=access`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5303":{"id":"/docs/guide-35","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**设置** 的 **访问** 标签页","locale":"zh-CN"},"5304":{"id":"/docs/guide-36","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"右上角有两个按钮：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5305":{"id":"/docs/guide-37","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"**实时活动**：没有调用时是一个活动图标；有调用正在进行时变成转圈的图标并显示数量（**N 个调用进行中**）。点开是实时活动面板：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5306":{"id":"/docs/guide-38","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"顶部是连接状态（**实时**、**正在重连…**、**离线**）和今天的 **今日 Token**、**调用次数**、**缓存命中**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5307":{"id":"/docs/guide-39","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"**正在进行（N）** 为每个调用显示一张卡片：模型、提供方 / 账户（还在选账户时显示 **正在选择账户…**）、接口、推理强度、尝试过的账户数，一条 **等待中**、**思考中**、**回答中** 的进度条，以及 **首字延迟**、**输出 Token**（在站点报告最终数量之前是按已输出文本的估算，带 ≈）和 **tok/s**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5308":{"id":"/docs/guide-40","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"**刚刚完成** 列出最近 10 个调用，标明 **已回答** 或 **失败**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5309":{"id":"/docs/guide-41","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"**打开用量** 跳到 **用量** 页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5310":{"id":"/docs/guide-42","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"**主题**：在浅色、深色和跟随系统之间轮流切换。更多外观选项在 **设置 › 外观**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5311":{"id":"/docs/guide-43","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"实时活动、**概览** 的今日数字和 **用量** 页共用一条到服务器的实时连接（`/api/v1/stats/live`）。连接断开后会自动重连，重连时取得一份新的快照，不会漏掉中间的变化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5312":{"id":"/docs/guide-44","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#访问密钥","content":"服务器设置了工具访问密钥（`server.access_token`）时，打开界面会弹出 **请输入工具访问密钥**。输入密钥点 **登录**，界面会先向服务器验证；验证通过后，密钥保存在这个浏览器的 localStorage 中，之后不再询问。密钥错误时提示 **工具访问密钥不正确。**，原来保存的密钥不会被覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5313":{"id":"/docs/guide-45","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#访问密钥","content":"在 **设置 › 访问** 中修改或清除密钥后，当前浏览器会自动换成新密钥；其他浏览器需要重新登录。Playground 走的是管理接口，只需要工具访问密钥，不需要模型 API 密钥。两种密钥的区别见访问控制与安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5314":{"id":"/docs/guide-46","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#语言与外观","content":"界面默认跟随系统语言，支持 English、简体中文和日本語，可以在 **设置 › 常规 › 语言** 中固定一种。主题、主题色、对比度和动画在 **设置 › 外观** 中设置。这些都是浏览器端的偏好，保存在当前浏览器中，不写入服务器的配置文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5315":{"id":"/docs/guide-47","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#模型目录的加载","content":"**模型**、**Playground** 和 **设置** 中的模型选择器共用同一份模型目录。目录以流的方式加载：先显示缓存中的模型，各提供商再分别补上自己的结果，加载中显示 **正在加载供应商：已完成/总数**。某个提供商失败或超时（20 秒）时会列出它和原因，并保留已有的模型，点 **重试** 再加载一次。详见模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5316":{"id":"/docs/guide-48","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"<Card title=\"概览\" href=\"/docs/guide-overview\" description=\"今日用量、接口地址、渠道一览、版本与更新、默认模型。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"5317":{"id":"/docs/guide-49","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"<Card title=\"模型\" href=\"/docs/guide-models\" description=\"模型目录、能力标记、上下文长度、可用性探测，以及在 Playground 中试用。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"5318":{"id":"/docs/guide-50","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"<Card title=\"渠道\" href=\"/docs/guide-channels\" description=\"登录站点、添加密钥、续期与过期、余额与签到、额度、按渠道的网络线路。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"5319":{"id":"/docs/guide-51","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"<Card title=\"Playground\" href=\"/docs/guide-playground\" description=\"对话、历史、临时对话、分支、版本与重试、附件与图片、复制为 API 请求。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"5320":{"id":"/docs/guide-52","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"<Card title=\"Playground 工具\" href=\"/docs/guide-agent\" description=\"六种内置工具、批准模式、在对话中批准、运行中补充说明、后台命令与工作区。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"5321":{"id":"/docs/guide-53","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"<Card title=\"用量\" href=\"/docs/guide-usage\" description=\"时间范围、概要卡片、Token 趋势、速度、明细与调用记录。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"5322":{"id":"/docs/guide-54","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"<Card title=\"设置\" href=\"/docs/guide-settings\" description=\"常规、工具、访问、安全、网络、自动化、外观与关于。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"5323":{"id":"/docs","page_id":"/docs","type":"page","content":"Hoshimi","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs","locale":"zh-CN"},"5324":{"id":"/docs-0","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"Hoshimi 是一个兼容 OpenAI 与 Anthropic 的网关：把免费模型站点、云服务和本地模型接到同一套 API 和 Web UI 后面。本页介绍它能做什么，以及文档的组织方式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5325":{"id":"/docs-1","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#能做什么","content":"能做什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"5326":{"id":"/docs-2","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#文档板块","content":"文档板块","locale":"zh-CN"},"5327":{"id":"/docs-3","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#许可证","content":"许可证","locale":"zh-CN"},"5328":{"id":"/docs-4","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"Hoshimi 是一个用 Python 编写的模型网关。它把免费模型站点（Cline、TRAE、ZCode、Qoder、MiniMax、Gemini、CodeBuddy、Kilo、OpenCode Zen 等）、云服务（Azure、Cloudflare、Vertex、Bedrock、NVIDIA NIM 等）和本地或自建的 OpenAI 兼容服务接到**同一个本地服务器**后面：客户端只需要一个 Base URL 和一份模型目录，就能通过 Chat Completions、Responses 或 Anthropic Messages 调用其中任何一个模型；一个多语言的 Web UI 用来管理渠道和账户、浏览模型、聊天和查看用量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5329":{"id":"/docs-5","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"安装后执行 `hoshimi serve`，打开 `http://127.0.0.1:10600` 即可使用。OpenCode Zen 和 Kilo 的匿名入口默认启用，不需要账户，也不需要配置文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5330":{"id":"/docs-6","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"快速开始\" href=\"/docs/quick-start\" description=\"安装、启动、在 Playground 里聊第一句，再发出第一个 API 请求。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"5331":{"id":"/docs-7","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"安装\" href=\"/docs/installation\" description=\"系统要求、pip / uv / pipx、可选依赖、升级、源码安装与后台运行。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"5332":{"id":"/docs-8","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"首次运行\" href=\"/docs/first-run\" description=\"第一次打开 Web UI 时看到什么：登录、默认的匿名渠道、各个页面在哪里。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"5333":{"id":"/docs-9","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#能做什么","content":"功能","locale":"zh-CN"},"5334":{"id":"/docs-10","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#能做什么","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"5335":{"id":"/docs-11","page_id