ontent":"`http://localhost:8080/v1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6973":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-28","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#本地后端","content":"`/v1/models`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6974":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-29","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#本地后端","content":"Hoshimi 不扫描本地端口：只有添加了账号且渠道开启，才会连接这些地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6975":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-30","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#添加本地服务","content":"打开 **渠道**，在 **未设置** 筛选下找到 **LM Studio**、**LLaMA.cpp** 或 **Ollama**，点 **添加账号**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6976":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-31","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#添加本地服务","content":"鉴权方式为 **本地服务（密钥可选）**。**API 地址（可选）** 已预填默认地址，服务不在默认端口时改成实际地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6977":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-32","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#添加本地服务","content":"本地服务要求鉴权时填写 **API 密钥**，否则留空；需要时在 **模型 ID** 中限定模型。点 **保存账号**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6978":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-33","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#添加本地服务","content":"省略 `base_url` 时使用默认地址；账号可以只有一个 `id`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6979":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-34","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#添加本地服务","content":"`base_url` 必须是 HTTP(S) 地址，不能带用户名密码、查询参数或片段；不以 `/v1` 结尾时会自动补上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6980":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-35","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#添加本地服务","content":"`api_key`（或 `access_token`、`token`）有值时以 `Authorization: Bearer` 发送，没有就不带鉴权头。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6981":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-36","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#添加本地服务","content":"本地模型不会被标记为免费（`free` 为 `null`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6982":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-37","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#各后端的处理","content":"**LM Studio**：读取已加载模型的实际上下文长度（缓存 30 秒）。请求前做粗略检查：消息 JSON 字节数的四分之一加上 `max_tokens` 超过已加载的上下文时，直接返回 400（`LM Studio request exceeds this model's loaded context window`）。接近上限的请求仍以服务端的分词结果为准。思考级别通过 `reasoning_effort` 发送（`minimal` 映射为 `low`，`xhigh`、`max` 映射为 `high`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6983":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-38","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#各后端的处理","content":"**Ollama**：逐个读取模型的能力，只保留能做补全或工具调用的模型，并据此标记视觉、思考和工具能力；上下文长度取模型信息中的最大值。读取单个模型的详情失败时仍保留该模型。思考级别通过 `reasoning_effort` 发送（`minimal` 映射为 `low`，`xhigh` 映射为 `max`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6984":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-39","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#各后端的处理","content":"**llama.cpp**：思考开关映射到聊天模板参数：`chat_template_kwargs` 中的 `enable_thinking` 和 `thinking`。请求中已有 `enable_thinking` 时不能同时指定思考级别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6985":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-40","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#各后端的处理","content":"只有目录表明模型会思考时，才会出现思考菜单（含关闭选项 `none`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6986":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-41","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#常规-api-服务","content":"这些服务的地址、协议和目录接口已经内置，账号只需要密钥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6987":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-42","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#添加账号","content":"在 **渠道** 中选择服务，点 **添加账号**，鉴权方式为 **API 密钥**，填写 **API 密钥**，可选填 **API 地址（可选）** 和 **模型 ID**；OpenAI、xAI、Vercel AI Gateway 还有 **通信协议** 选项。部分服务也支持浏览器或设备码登录：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6988":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-43","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#添加账号","content":"渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"6989":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-44","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"