"/docs/providers-46","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#添加账号","content":"三种方式写入的是同一个文件：数据目录下的 `config.json`（用 `hoshimi config path` 查看位置）。网页界面和 `hoshimi login` 写入后立即生效；直接编辑文件需要重启服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7673":{"id":"/docs/providers-47","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#添加账号","content":"打开 **渠道** 页面，选中一个渠道。还没有账号的渠道在 **未设置** 筛选下。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7674":{"id":"/docs/providers-48","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#添加账号","content":"支持登录的渠道点 **登录**，按对话框提示在浏览器中完成授权；其余渠道点 **添加账号**，选择 **鉴权方式** 并填写表单，然后点 **保存账号**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7675":{"id":"/docs/providers-49","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#添加账号","content":"账号出现在 **账户** 列表中。添加账号会顺带开启被关闭的渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7676":{"id":"/docs/providers-50","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#添加账号","content":"同一站点身份重新登录时，会更新原有账号，而不是再叠加一个。删除账号用账号菜单中的 **删除**，凭据会同时从 `config.json` 和运行中的账号池移除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7677":{"id":"/docs/providers-51","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#添加账号","content":"账号的令牌和密钥都以明文保存在 `config.json` 中。不要提交或分享填过真实凭据的文件；分享示例时用占位符替换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7678":{"id":"/docs/providers-52","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#每个渠道的配置键","content":"键","locale":"zh-CN"},"7679":{"id":"/docs/providers-53","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#每个渠道的配置键","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"7680":{"id":"/docs/providers-54","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#每个渠道的配置键","content":"`providers.<id>.enabled`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7681":{"id":"/docs/providers-55","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#每个渠道的配置键","content":"`false` 完全关闭该渠道（匿名入口也用它关闭）。省略时为开启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7682":{"id":"/docs/providers-56","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#每个渠道的配置键","content":"`providers.<id>.accounts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7683":{"id":"/docs/providers-57","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#每个渠道的配置键","content":"账号列表，每项是一个对象，字段由渠道决定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7684":{"id":"/docs/providers-58","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#每个渠道的配置键","content":"`providers.<id>.accounts[].id`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7685":{"id":"/docs/providers-59","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#每个渠道的配置键","content":"账号名，用于界面、用量统计和日志。省略时由网关命名（登录产生的账号形如 `cline-1a2b3c`，按位置推断的形如 `<id>-0`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7686":{"id":"/docs/providers-60","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#每个渠道的配置键","content":"`providers.<id>.options`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7687":{"id":"/docs/providers-61","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#每个渠道的配置键","content":"渠道级选项，例如 TRAE 的 `channel`、agg 的能力声明、本地服务的 `models`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7688":{"id":"/docs/providers-62","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#每个渠道的配置键","content":"`providers.<id>.options.network`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7689":{"id":"/docs/providers-63","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#每个渠道的配置键","content":"该渠道自己的网络线路，默认继承全局设置，见网络与代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7690":{"id":"/docs/providers-64","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#选择模型路由规则","content":"客户端在请求的 `model` 字段中指定模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7691":{"id":"/docs/providers-65","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#选择模型路由规则","content":"写成 `渠道/模型`（例如 `opencode/big-pickle`、`nvidia/<model-id>`）会直接交给该渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7692":{"id":"/docs/providers-66","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#选择模型路由规则","content":"只写模型 ID 时，网关按固定顺序查找第一个列出该 ID 的渠道：`cline`、`opencode`、`kilo`、`gemini`、`zcode`、`minimax`、`trae`、`qoder`、`qodercn`、`buddy`、`workbuddy`、`codearts`、`loomy`、`raccoon`、`lobsterai`、`eac`、`agg`、`zhipu`、`nvidia`，然后是其他渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7693":{"id":"/docs/providers-67","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#选择模型路由规则","content":"只开启了一个渠道时，未知的 ID 也会原样转给它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7694":{"id":"/docs/providers-68","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#选择模型路由规则","content":"`GET /v1/models` 中每个 ID 只出现一次，`owned_by` 是按上述顺序胜出的渠道。模型 ID 本身含有 `/` 时（例如 Kilo 的 `openrouter/free`），建议加上渠道前缀：`kilo/openrouter/free`，避免第一段被当成渠道名。客户端配置见接入客户端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7695":{"id":"/docs/providers-69","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#账号池与轮换","content":"同一渠道的多个账号按配置顺序使用。一次请求遇到账号层面的失败时，网关会换下一个账号重试，每次请求最多尝试 `server.max_account_retries` 个账号（默认 3）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7696":{"id":"/docs/providers-70","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#账号池与轮换","content":"额度用尽或限流：该账号暂停轮换，时长取上游给出的重置时间，没有则为一小时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7697":{"id":"/docs/providers-71","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#账号池与轮换","content":"凭据被拒：先尝试续期，再换账号。续期令牌本身被拒绝时，账号标记为 **需要登录**，不再参与轮换，直到重新登录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7698":{"id":"/docs/providers-72","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#账号池与轮换","content":"已经向客户端输出内容后，请求不会自动重放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7699":{"id":"/docs/providers-73","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#账号池与轮换","content":"这些规则的完整说明见模型行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7700":{"id":"/docs/providers-74","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#续期与签到","content":"很多登录型站点的令牌会过期。开启 **凭据续期**（`server.auto_refresh`，默认开启）后，网关每 30 分钟检查一次，续期一小时内到期或没有记录到期时间的账号。开启 **每日签到**（`server.auto_checkin`，默认开启）后，网关每天按北京时间日期为支持签到的站点领取免费额度。哪些站点支持续期、签到和余额查询，见免费站点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7701":{"id":"/docs/providers-75","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#怎样选择","content":"先试默认开启的匿名入口，不需要任何账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7702":{"id":"/docs/providers-76","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#怎样选择","content":"想要更多免费额度，登录免费站点；多登录几个账号能让轮换更从容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7703":{"id":"/docs/providers-77","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#怎样选择","content":"已有某个 OpenAI 兼容服务的密钥：它在原生渠道列表中就用原生渠道（见本地与兼容端点），否则用 agg。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7704":{"id":"/docs/providers-78","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#怎样选择","content":"企业云账号用云平台对应的渠道；本机模型用 LM Studio、Ollama 或 llama.cpp。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7705":{"id":"/docs/providers-79","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#怎样选择","content":"<Card title=\"匿名入口\" href=\"/docs/providers-anonymous\" description=\"OpenCode Zen 和 Kilo：无需账号的免费模型。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"7706":{"id":"/docs/providers-80","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#怎样选择","content":"<Card title=\"免费站点\" href=\"/docs/providers-stations\" description=\"每个登录型站点怎样登录、提供什么、注意什么。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"7707":{"id":"/docs/providers-81","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#怎样选择","content":"<Card title=\"聚合入口 agg\" href=\"/docs/providers-agg\" description=\"任意 OpenAI 兼容站点，以及 22 个站点预设。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"7708":{"id":"/docs/providers-82","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#怎样选择","content":"<Card title=\"云平台\" href=\"/docs/providers-cloud\" description=\"Azure、Cloudflare、Gemini、Vertex、Bedrock 与特殊协议。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"7709":{"id":"/docs/providers-83","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#怎样选择","content":"<Card title=\"NVIDIA NIM\" href=\"/docs/providers-nvidia\" description=\"NVIDIA 托管模型的账号与兼容转换。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"7710":{"id":"/docs/providers-84","page_id":"/docs/providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers#怎样选择","content":"<Card title=\"本地与兼容端点\" href=\"/docs/providers-local\" description=\"LM Studio、Ollama、llama.cpp 和按密钥接入的常规 API。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"7711":{"id":"/docs/quick-start","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"page","content":"快速开始","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start","locale":"zh-CN"},"7712":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-0","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start","content":"从零到第一次对话：安装 Hoshimi、启动服务器、在 Playground 里和模型聊一句，再用 curl 发出第一个 API 请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7713":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-1","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#安装","content":"安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"7714":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-2","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#启动服务器","content":"启动服务器","locale":"zh-CN"},"7715":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-3","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼概览页","content":"看一眼概览页","locale":"zh-CN"},"7716":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-4","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#在-playground-里聊第一句","content":"在 Playground 里聊第一句","locale":"zh-CN"},"7717":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-5","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#发出第一个-api-请求","content":"发出第一个 API 请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"7718":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-6","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#命令行中的同样检查","content":"命令行中的同样检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"7719":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-7","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#接下来","content":"接下来","locale":"zh-CN"},"7720":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-8","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start","content":"本页走最短的路线，只用默认启用的匿名渠道，不需要任何账户。每一步的细节见安装和首次运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7721":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-9","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#安装","content":"需要 Python 3.10 或更高版本。从 PyPI 安装：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7722":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-10","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#安装","content":"发行包已经包含构建好的 Web UI，不需要 Node 或 Bun。用 uv 或 pipx 安装、云平台的可选依赖见安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7723":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-11","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#启动服务器","content":"服务器就绪后终端会打印一行 `SERVER_READY url=http://127.0.0.1:10600`，浏览器随后自动打开这个地址。默认只监听本机（`127.0.0.1`），端口 **10600**；端口被占用时会自动换用下一个空闲端口，此时以终端打印的 URL 为准。按 Ctrl+C 停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7724":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-12","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#启动服务器","content":"`python -m hoshimi serve` 与 `hoshimi serve` 等价。不想自动打开浏览器时加 `--no-open`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7725":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-13","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼概览页","content":"界面打开后进入 **概览** 页。**渠道** 一栏里已经有两个渠道：**OpenCode Zen** 和 **Kilo AI**，都标着 **无需账户**。它们是默认启用的匿名入口，能用哪些模型取决于上游当时的目录、额度和服务状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7726":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-14","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼概览页","content":"**接口** 一栏列出客户端要用的地址（`/v1/chat/completions`、`/v1/responses`、`/v1/messages` 等），每行都可以一键复制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7727":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-15","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#在-playground-里聊第一句","content":"在左侧导航栏打开 **Playground**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7728":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-16","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#在-playground-里聊第一句","content":"输入框下方的 **模型** 选择器已经选中了目录里的第一个模型；点它可以搜索并换成别的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7729":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-17","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#在-playground-里聊第一句","content":"在输入框（**有问题，尽管问…**）里输入一句话，按 Enter 发送（Shift+Enter 换行）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7730":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-18","