ce. With nobody subscribed, none of this costs anything.","locale":"en"},"8420":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage-153","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-usage#the-live-view","content":"Each subscriber may fall at most 1000 events behind. A connection that reads too slowly is closed; on reconnecting it gets a fresh `snapshot`, which replaces everything it missed.","locale":"en"},"8421":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage-154","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-usage#the-live-view","content":"When the server shuts down, this stream ends first so it never holds up the shutdown.","locale":"en"},"8422":{"id":"/en/docs/api-anthropic","page_id":"/en/docs/api-anthropic","type":"page","content":"Anthropic-compatible API","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi Documentation","API reference"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/api-anthropic","locale":"en"},"8423":{"id":"/en/docs/api-anthropic-0","page_id":"/en/docs/api-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-anthropic","content":"Reference for /v1/messages and /v1/messages/count_tokens: request validation, how native forwarding or protocol conversion is chosen, the fields and content blocks conversion supports, thinking-signature replay, effort mapping, stream events, token counting and errors.","locale":"en"},"8424":{"id":"/en/docs/api-anthropic-1","page_id":"/en/docs/api-anthropic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/api-anthropic#request-validation","content":"Request validation","locale":"en"},"8425":{"id":"/en/docs/api-anthropic-2","page_id":"/en/docs/api-anthropic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/api-anthropic#native-forwarding-or-protocol-conversion","content":"Native forwarding or protocol conversion","locale":"en"},"8426":{"id":"/en/docs/api-anthropic-3","page_id":"/en/docs/api-anthropic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/api-anthropic#native-forwarding","content":"Native forwarding","locale":"en"},"8427":{"i