","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-management","content":"**Authentication**: with a tool access key (`server.access_token`) set, every endpoint except `GET /api/v1/app/health` needs `Authorization: Bearer <tool-access-key>`; a missing or wrong key answers `401` (`auth_required`). `x-api-key` and the model API key do not work here.","locale":"en"},"8609":{"id":"/en/docs/api-management-16","page_id":"/en/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-management","content":"**Errors**: `{\"code\": \"...\", \"message\": \"...\", \"detail\": {}}`, usually with `400` (`invalid_input`), `404` (`not_found`) or `409` (`conflict`); a body that does not match the schema gets the framework's `422`. See API overview.","locale":"en"},"8610":{"id":"/en/docs/api-management-17","page_id":"/en/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-management","content":"**Fields**: the running server's `/openapi.json` has every endpoint's full schema; the Web UI's types are generated from it.","locale":"en"},"8611":{"id":"/en/docs/api-management-18","page_id":"/en/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-management","content":"**Playground**: `/api/v1/playground/*` is covered in Playground API.","locale":"en"},"8612":{"id":"/en/docs/api-management-19","page_id":"/en/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-management","content":"The examples use `ACCESS_KEY` for the tool access key:","locale":"en"},"8613":{"id":"/en/docs/api-management-20","page_id":"/en/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-management#endpoints","content":"Method and path","locale":"en"},"8614":{"id":"/en/docs/api-management-21","page_id":"/en/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-management#endpoints","content":"Purpose","locale":"en"},"8615":{"id":"/en/docs/api-management-22","page_id":"/en/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-management#endpoints