g up and resetting","locale":"en"},"10343":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-11","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths","content":"All of Hoshimi's state lives in one data directory: the configuration file, the database that records usage and conversations, and a few files meant for people or other programs to read. Moving, backing up or resetting Hoshimi means dealing with this one folder.","locale":"en"},"10344":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-12","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#where-the-data-directory-is","content":"System","locale":"en"},"10345":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-13","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#where-the-data-directory-is","content":"Default location","locale":"en"},"10346":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-14","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#where-the-data-directory-is","content":"Linux","locale":"en"},"10347":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-15","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#where-the-data-directory-is","content":"`~/.local/share/hoshimi`, or `$XDG_DATA_HOME/hoshimi` when `XDG_DATA_HOME` is set","locale":"en"},"10348":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-16","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#where-the-data-directory-is","content":"macOS","locale":"en"},"10349":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-17","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#where-the-data-directory-is","content":"`~/Library/Application Support/hoshimi`","locale":"en"},"10350":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-18","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#where-the-data-directory-is","content":"Windows","locale":"en"},"10351":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-19","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#where-the-data-directory-is","content":"`%APPDATA%\\hoshimi`","locale":"en"},"10352":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-20","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#where-the-data-directory-is","content":"The `HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR` environment variable moves it anywhere (`~` is expanded and the path is made absolute). The server and every command find the data directory through this variable, so for `hoshimi config`, `hoshimi login` and the rest to work on the same data, set the same value wherever you run them:","locale":"en"},"10353":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-21","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#where-the-data-directory-is","content":"To see the location in use:","locale":"en"},"10354":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-22","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#where-the-data-directory-is","content":"`hoshimi config path` prints the config file's path; its folder is the data directory;","locale":"en"},"10355":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-23","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#where-the-data-directory-is","content":"`hoshimi env` lists the environment variables Hoshimi reads and the ones currently set;","locale":"en"},"10356":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-24","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#where-the-data-directory-is","content":"the Web UI's **Settings** › **About** shows the **Data directory**, **Config file** and **Database**;","locale":"en"},"10357":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-25","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#where-the-data-directory-is","content":"`GET /api/v1/settings` returns `data_dir` and `config_path`.","locale":"en"},"10358":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-26","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#what-is-in-it","content":"Not every file is always there: each is created the first time it is needed. By design, records that grow with traffic go into the database, and things people edit or other programs read stay plain files.","locale":"en"},"10359":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-27","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#what-is-in-it","content":"File","locale":"en"},"10360":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-28","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#what-is-in-it","content":"Contents","locale":"en"},"10361":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-29","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#what-is-in-it","content":"Notes","locale":"en"},"10362":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-30","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#what-is-in-it","content":"`config.json`","locale":"en"},"10363":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-31","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#what-is-in-it","content":"Every setting and the channel accounts' credentials","locale":"en"},"10364":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-32","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#what-is-in-it","content":"See Configuration file. Holds plain-text tokens; restricted to its owner where possible","locale":"en"},"10365":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-33","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#what-is-in-it","content":"`hoshimi.db`","locale":"en"},"10366":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-34","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/config-paths#what-is-in-it","content":"Usage statistics, check-in state and history, probe verdicts, Playground conversations and attachments","locale":"en"},"10367":{"id":"/en/docs/config-paths-35","page_id":"/en/docs/config-paths","tags":[