round.shells` (read-only): where the tools work, the shell commands run in when a call names none (`auto` resolved), and the shells installed on this machine."],[966,"`playground.workspace_path`、`playground.shell_in_effect` 和 `playground.shells`（只读）：工具实际的工作目录、调用未指定 shell 时命令运行所用的 shell（`auto` 已解析），以及本机已安装的 shell。"],[2932,"`playground.workspace`"],[4442,"`playground.workspace`"],[5033,"`playground.workspace`"],[10671,"`playground.workspace`"],[12181,"`playground.workspace`"],[12770,"`playground.workspace`"],[555,"`playground`"],[2820,"`playground`"],[8294,"`playground`"],[10559,"`playground`"],[3305,"`policy_block_seconds`"],[11044,"`policy_block_seconds`"],[3397,"`policy_blocked`"],[11136,"`policy_blocked`"],[3396,"`PolicyBlocked`"],[11135,"`PolicyBlocked`"],[6819,"`poolside`"],[6820,"`poolside`"],[7309,"`poolside`"],[14556,"`poolside`"],[14557,"`poolside`"],[15046,"`poolside`"],[8002,"`POST /api/v1/models/unavailable/reset` or a server restart clears every record."],[263,"`POST /api/v1/models/unavailable/reset` 或重启服务器清除所有记录。"],[1324,"`POST /attachments`"],[9063,"`POST /attachments`"],[1336,"`POST /chat/completions`"],[9075,"`POST /chat/completions`"],[9404,"`POST /chat/completions` takes an OpenAI Chat Completions request (see OpenAI-compatible API) and answers like `/v1/chat/completions`, but with the tool access key instead of the model API key, and recorded in Usage under the `playground` origin. `playground.system_prompt` goes first unless the request has a `system` or `developer` message. Nothing is kept as a conversation."],[1665,"`POST /chat/completions` 接受 OpenAI Chat Completions 请求（见 OpenAI 兼容 API），响应与 `/v1/chat/completions` 相同，但使用工具访问密钥而不是模型 API 密钥，并以 `playground` 来源记录在用量中。请求中没有 `system` 或 `developer` 消息时，先发送 `playground.system_prompt`。不会保存为对话。"],[1300,"`POST /conversations/{id}/approvals/{call_id}`"],[9039,"`POST /conversations/{id}/approvals/{call_id}`"],[1312,"`POST /conversations/{id}/branch`"],[9051,"`POST /conversations/{id}/branch`"],[9401,"`POST /conversations/{id}/branch` with `{\"message_id\": \"...\"}` creates a conversation holding the path up to that message, under new ids, with the same title, model, effort and approval mode, and `branched_from` set. Answers `201` with the full conversation."],[1662,"`POST /conversations/{id}/branch`，请求体 `{\"message_id\": \"...\"}`，新建一个对话，包含截至该消息的路径（使用新的 ID），沿用标题、模型、推理强度和审批模式，并设置 `branched_from`。返回 `201` 和完整对话。"],[1318,"`POST /conversations/{id}/compact`"],[9057,"`POST /conversations/{id}/compact`"],[9398,"`POST /conversations/{id}/compact` compacts the conversation now, with an optional `instructions` (what the summary should pay attention to). It streams `checkpoint` (the checkpoint message as filed, its step `running`) and `done` (as kept). A `done` with `status` `error` means it failed and the conversation is as it was; closing the connection stops it the same way. It answers `409` while a reply is running and `400` when there is nothing to compact (no reply since the last compaction). Send the next question with the checkpoint's id as `parent_id`."],[1659,"`POST /conversations/{id}/compact` 立即压缩对话，可附带 `instructions`（总结应关注的内容）。它依次推送 `checkpoint`（保存后的检查点消息，步骤状态为 `running`）和 `done`（最终保存的结果）。`done` 的 `status` 为 `error` 表示失败，对话保持原样；断开连接也会同样停止。有回复正在运行时返回 `409`，没有可压缩的内容（上次压缩后没有新回复）时返回 `400`。下一个问题以检查点的 ID 作为 `parent_id` 发送。"],[1288,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/retry`"],[9027,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/retry`"],[9289,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/retry` streams another reply, with the same events except `user`. `message_id` is a reply (the new one goes beside it) or a question left unanswered (it gets its first reply)."],[1550,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/retry` 流式生成另一条回复，事件与发送相同，只是没有 `user`。`message_id` 可以是一条回复（新回复与它并列），也可以是一个还没有回复的问题（为它生成第一条回复）。"],[1285,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages`"],[9024,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages`"],[9222,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages` adds a question and streams the reply."],[1483,"`POST /conversations/{id}/messages` 添加一个问题并流式返回回复。"],[1303,"`POST /conversations/{id}/steer`"],[9042,"`POST /conversations/{id}/steer`"],[9357,"`POST /conversations/{id}/steer` with `{\"content\": \"...\"}` sends a message to the reply under way, without stopping it. It answers `202` with `{\"id\": \"steer_…\"}`."],[1618,"`POST /conversations/{id}/steer`，请求体 `{\"content\": \"...\"}`，向正在进行的回复发送消息而不停止它。返回 `202` 和 `{\"id\": \"steer_…\"}`。"],[1297,"`POST /conversations/{id}/stop`"],[9036,"`POST /conversations/{id}/stop`"],[9285,"`POST /conversations/{id}/stop` stops it: a running tool is told to stop, a waiting approval is dropped, and the reply is kept as `stopped` with what came so far. Every stream following it ends with that `done`."],[1546,"`POST /conversations/{id}/stop` 停止回复：正在运行的工具被要求停止，等待中的批准被取消，回复连同已生成的内容保存为 `stopped`。所有跟随它的流都以这个 `done` 结束。"],[1315,"`POST /conversations/{id}/title`"],[9054,"`POST /conversations/{id}/title`"],[9400,"`POST /conversations/{id}/title` has a model name the conversation after its first exchange, and waits for it. The model is `playground.title_model`, else the conversation's own. A temporary conversation, one titled by a model already, and one with your own title are left as they are; if the model fails, the title stays. Answers the summary."],[1661,"`POST /conversations/{id}/title` 让模型根据第一轮问答为对话命名，并等待模型完成。使用 `playground.title_model`，未设置则用对话自身的模型。临时对话、已由模型命名的对话和你自己设置了标题的对话保持不变；模型调用失败时标题也不变。返回对话摘要。"],[1273,"`POST /conversations`"],[9012,"`POST /conversations`"],[920,"`POST /credits/claim`"],[1028,"`POST /credits/claim`"],[8659,"`POST /credits/claim`"],[8767,"`POST /credits/claim`"],[930,"`POST /login/cancel`"],[8669,"`POST /login/cancel`"],[928,"`POST /login/input`"],[8667,"`POST /login/input`"],[924,"`POST /login/start`"],[8663,"`POST /login/start`"],[906,"`POST /models/unavailable/reset`"],[8645,"`POST /models/unavailable/reset`"],[8752,"`POST /models/unavailable/reset` lets every held-out model back in and returns `{\"cleared\": <count>}`."],[1013,"`POST /models/unavailable/reset` 解除所有被暂时停用的模型，返回 `{\"cleared\": <数量>}`。"],[910,"`POST /probe`"],[8649,"`POST /probe`"],[8754,"`POST /probe` starts a round in the background; the body is optional:"],[1015,"`POST /probe` 在后台开始一轮探测，请求体可选："],[892,"`POST /providers/{provider_id}/accounts`"],[8631,"`POST /providers/{provider_id}/accounts`"],[8716,"`POST /providers/{provider_id}/accounts` appends one account; the `account` in the body is exactly what you would write in `config.json`:"],[977,"`POST /providers/{provider_id}/accounts` 追加一个账号，请求体中的 `account` 与写在 `config.json` 里的形式完全相同："],[914,"`POST /refresh`"],[8653,"`POST /refresh`"],[8757,"`POST /refresh` renews credentials that are due, with an optional body `{\"provider\": \"<provider>\", \"force\": true}` (`force` renews every refreshable account, due or not). It returns one outcome per account: `ok`, `persisted` (the new credential was saved to the config), `terminal` (the station refused the refresh token; the account needs a new sign-in) and `error`."],[1018,"`POST /refresh` 立即续期即将到期的凭据，请求体可选：`{\"provider\": \"<渠道>\", \"force\": true}`（`force` 表示不管是否到期，续期所有可续期的账号）。返回每个账号的结果：`ok`、`persisted`（新凭据已写入配置）、`terminal`（站点拒绝了刷新令牌，需要重新登录）、`error`。"],[545,"`POST /v1/chat/completions`"],[1080,"`POST /v1/chat/completions`"],[1091,"`POST /v1/chat/completions`"],[2420,"`POST /v1/chat/completions`"],[8284,"`POST /v1/chat/completions`"],[8819,"`POST /v1/chat/completions`"],[8830,"`POST /v1/chat/completions`"],[10159,"`POST /v1/chat/completions`"],[1088,"`POST /v1/classify`"],[8827,"`POST /v1/classify`"],[703,"`POST /v1/messages/count_tokens`"],[837,"`POST /v1/messages/count_tokens`"],[8442,"`POST /v1/messages/count_tokens`"],[8576,"`POST /v1/messages/count_tokens`"],[551,"`POST /v1/messages`"],[701,"`POST /v1/messages`"],[2426,"`POST /v1/messages`"],[8290,"`POST /v1/messages`"],[8440,"`POST /v1/messages`"],[10165,"`POST /v1/messages`"],[548,"`POST /v1/responses`"],[1082,"`POST /v1/