te"],[9504,"The request is invalid; the message says why"],[8029,"The request itself"],[10287,"The request succeeded"],[7889,"The request's `model` is resolved in this order:"],[8309,"The requested model, and the channel and account that actually answered"],[13439,"The resource name; the default root is `https://<resource>.openai.azure.com/openai/v1`."],[8976,"The response is `{\"provider\", \"model\", \"answers\", \"usage\"}`: a `bool` answer is `{\"type\": \"bool\", \"probability\": …}`; a `score` answer carries `score` and `confidence`; a `choice` answer carries `choice`, `probabilities` and `confidence`."],[9242,"The response is `text/event-stream`. Each event is one `data:` line holding a JSON object whose `type` names it:"],[8467,"The response keeps `content-type`, `request-id`, `x-request-id`, `retry-after` (rounded up to whole seconds), `x-should-retry` and every `anthropic-*` header."],[12023,"The result lists the files added (`A`), modified (`M`) and deleted (`D`)."],[9295,"The retried reply's effort; for a question, the conversation's. `\"\"` sends none"],[9293,"The retried reply's model; for a question, the conversation's"],[12128,"The review model denied it; the model reads why"],[12116,"The review model is judging it"],[12074,"The reviewer is sent:"],[12338,"The route covers every request the gateway makes for this channel: model catalogue, inference, login, token refresh, balance and check-in. Once saved, a proxy address is never shown again, only **Proxy configured; save to replace it.** A proxy that cannot be reached never falls back to a direct connection."],[12830,"The route is used for every request the gateway makes: model catalogue, inference, login, token refresh, balance, check-in, and the PyPI version check. A proxy address may hold a user name and password, so once saved the interface only says **Proxy configured; save to replace it.** A proxy that cannot be reached never falls back to a direct connection. Changes apply to new requests; streams already running finish on their original connections."],[9000,"The routes are part of the management API (see Management API):"],[9568,"The running server has its own Swagger UI (`/docs`) and OpenAPI document (`/openapi.json`) listing every endpoint's fields; they are the authoritative reference. These pages explain usage; `/docs` describes structure."],[9004,"The running server's `/docs` and `/openapi.json` list every field (see API overview)."],[9782,"The running server's host, actual port, URL and PID"],[8126,"The same 10 minutes and 3 strikes; in memory only, cleared by a restart or `POST /api/v1/models/unavailable/reset`"],[15455,"The same checks from the command line"],[8131,"The same header order, lenient number parsing"],[13298,"The same ID at two stations can be two different models at two different prices, so the gateway records which station each ID came from:"],[7950,"The same level when the menu has it; otherwise `minimal` becomes `low`"],[7959,"The same level when the menu has it; otherwise `xhigh` becomes `max`"],[8534,"The same level; `max` becomes `xhigh`"],[12249,"The same logins work from the command line, which suits a server without a desktop:"],[8120,"The same model on another account; the caller chooses the model"],[8132,"The same order, strict parsing: `10 requests` is not read as 10 but counted as an unreadable header"],[8123,"The same table, used to decide whether to try another account"],[8129,"The same threshold; accepted when the next cycle says the same"],[11016,"The same, `adapter=\"local\"` (`lmstudio`, `llamacpp`, `ollama`)"],[11353,"The scripts in `scripts/`:"],[11791,"The scrollbar lane is on the end side only, so the end padding takes it out and content sits evenly between both sides"],[11801,"The scrollbar's place is kept while nothing overflows (`scrollbar-gutter: stable`), so content does not shift when a scrollbar appears; menus and pickers give it up with `app-scroll-auto`."],[9928,"The SDK's `api_key` parameter sends `x-api-key` and its `auth_token` parameter sends `Authorization: Bearer`; Hoshimi accepts both. When both are present, `Authorization` wins."],[9930,"The SDK's streaming helper works as is:"],[12452,"The server asks PyPI once in the background after it starts, then once a day. It only reads the version number; nothing is downloaded or installed. The check goes out through the global network settings. To keep Hoshimi from making this request, set `server.check_updates` to `false`; the **Latest version** row is then left out:"],[8187,"The server listens on loopback and the request's `Host` is not `localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, `::1` or the listening address. Typical with a reverse proxy forwarding the public name, or a custom local host name. Have the proxy forward `Host: 127.0.0.1:<port>`"],[8137,"The server will not start"],[11642,"The server's address"],[13152,"The service uses the data folder of the user it runs as; to choose the location, add `Environment=HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR=/srv/hoshimi` under `[Service]` (see Environment variables). `GET /health` needs no key and returns `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`, which makes it a liveness check:"],[12417,"The share of input tokens read from the upstream cache"],[12637,"The share of the window (0.5 to 0.95) at which a conversation is compacted"],[10698,"The share of the window at which a conversation is compacted; sooner when what is left could not hold a reply"],[11279,"The shared checks: Ruff, ty, pytest, the Web UI and API contract; see Testing"],[11735,"The shared component library, exported from `ui/index.ts`; also `layers.ts` and `motion/`"],[11729,"The shell and its navigation destinations; the route table"],[10686,"The shell commands run in when the model names none: `auto` is bash (`sh` without it; PowerShell on Windows, `cmd` without it). `\"pwsh\"` is accepted for `powershell`. A shell that is not installed falls back to `auto`"],[11972,"The shield menu in the composer"],[7773,"The signature covers the body's hash, so the body is 